# TODO: Translation updated at 2023-06-05 19:09

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:17
translate chinese ch1ep2_8cf4dd58:

    # nee "Whoopsies! Let me stop you right there for a moment."
    nee "哎呀！我得先打断你一下。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:18
translate chinese ch1ep2_c4d9d781:

    # nee "What you're about to see next is one of Nii's fancy-schmancy."
    nee "你接下来马上要看到的是Niichan搞出来的一个新鲜东西。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:19
translate chinese ch1ep2_26b11c2e:

    # nee "We are going to implement a new mechanic into the game to make it feel more like..."
    nee "我们打算在游戏里加入一个新的机制，好让它更像是……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:20
translate chinese ch1ep2_33fa14b0:

    # nee "Well..."
    nee "呃……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:21
translate chinese ch1ep2_439d6c6a:

    # nee "A game!"
    nee "一个游戏！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:22
translate chinese ch1ep2_a302a2e7:

    # nee "But don't worry: for now, there will be no consequences at all."
    nee "不过不用担心，目前来说，不会有任何不好的后果。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:23
translate chinese ch1ep2_5d365f0a:

    # nee "So give Nii you're thoughts about this mechanic. It will help him decide what to do with it."
    nee "所以请把你对这个机制的看法告诉Niichan，好帮助他决定到底要不要保留、修改这个机制。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:24
translate chinese ch1ep2_5e2d2420:

    # nee "What is it, you may ask?"
    nee "你问，到底是什么机制？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:25
translate chinese ch1ep2_746827e6:

    # nee "Let's have Nii bring it out for us, shall we?"
    nee "那就让Niichan把东西拉出来看看？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:29
translate chinese ch1ep2_6809270a:

    # nee "Et voilà!"
    nee "就是这个！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:30
translate chinese ch1ep2_b14ef476:

    # nee "Yes, what you're seeing at the top of the screen is a stopwatch of your {b}thought process{/b}."
    nee "没错，在屏幕上方出现的就是一个计时，用来反映你的{b}思考时间{/b}。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:31
translate chinese ch1ep2_b8568ec0:

    # nee "It only contains seconds and milliseconds and has purposely been slowed down to make you feel like a genius."
    nee "这个计时只有秒和毫秒，并且被故意放慢了，目的是为了让你觉得自己是个天才。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:32
translate chinese ch1ep2_ba48598f:

    # nee "Which, of course, you are!"
    nee "你也的确是个天才！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:33
translate chinese ch1ep2_2e301fe1:

    # nee "Now, this stopwatch will only appear during critical moments that will test your reading speed, response or choice-picking speed, hand reflexes, and more!"
    nee "目前来说，这个计时只会在关键时刻出现，考验你的阅读速度，反应或者选择速度，手速快慢，以及其他的能力！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:34
translate chinese ch1ep2_24e21480:

    # nee "It's a very flexible mechanic that can be used in many scenarios in the future."
    nee "这个机制非常灵活，可以用在将来的许多场景里。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:35
translate chinese ch1ep2_5db68998:

    # nee "Every critical moment has a time limit, and you will have to do something before your time runs out."
    nee "每个关键时刻都会有时间限制，而你必须在计时结束之前做出反应。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:36
translate chinese ch1ep2_cec032b7:

    # nee "If you're successful, you will be greatly rewarded."
    nee "如果你成功了，就会得到丰厚的奖励。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:37
translate chinese ch1ep2_7d24c6f5:

    # nee "However, once you go over the time limit, there will be consequences that could affect your future gameplay or even result in a bad ending."
    nee "然而，如果超过了时限，产生的后果就可能影响到将来的剧情，甚至进入坏结局。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:38
translate chinese ch1ep2_2032d1a5:

    # nee "So be careful, and be quick."
    nee "所以要谨慎，还要够快。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:39
translate chinese ch1ep2_7d949130:

    # nee "Here, for example: if we were to implement the mechanic now:"
    nee "举个例子，假如我们现在就要应用这个机制的话："

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:40
translate chinese ch1ep2_bf69cb83:

    # nee "\"You'll have to keep Francis at bay\""
    nee "“你必须拖住弗朗西斯”"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:41
translate chinese ch1ep2_b47c255b:

    # nee "You'll have to read through the dialogues and pick a choice before the stopwatch reaches {b}five seconds{/b}."
    nee "你要尽快读完对话，并且在计时到达{b}五秒{/b}之前做出选择。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:42
translate chinese ch1ep2_28105d94:

    # nee "Or else, Francis will force himself into the house resulting in a bad ending."
    nee "不然的话，弗朗西斯就会强行进入房子，导致坏结局。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:43
translate chinese ch1ep2_f9470605:

    # nee "Don't worry though, Nii will make it easy for you. Furthermore, I'll be there with you during these moments to guide you."
    nee "不用担心，Niichan不会给你太大的难题的。在那些情况出现的时候，我会出现，并给你引导。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:44
translate chinese ch1ep2_116c32eb:

    # nee "And sorry, you can't fap to me. Only NiiChan can."
    nee  "但是不好意思，你不能对着我撸。只有Niichan可以。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:45
translate chinese ch1ep2_83c3ab97:

    # nee "Not like you'd have time to during these moments, anyway."
    nee  "不过反正你在那种情况下也不会有时间做那种事的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:46
translate chinese ch1ep2_c76f32ae:

    # nee "But if you're really curious, he keeps many of my nudes somewhere in his secret folders, so why don't you ask him for one?"
    nee  "但是，假如你真的很好奇的话……他在他的秘密文件夹里藏了很多我的色图，你要不去问他要几张？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:47
translate chinese ch1ep2_ffa6b60b:

    # nee "He even has one of me being de-{w=0.5}{nw}"
    nee  "他甚至还有我被——{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:48
translate chinese ch1ep2_49c0e937:

    # nee "I mean, that's about it for me."
    nee "好了好了，关于我的事就说这么多吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:49
translate chinese ch1ep2_81f07d08:

    # nee "I'll see you in future updates!"
    nee "我们在之后的更新里再见！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:53
translate chinese ch1ep2_d510cf06:

    # nee "This critical moment will now start in..."
    nee "这次的关键时刻马上就要开始……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:54
translate chinese ch1ep2_292f7f1a:

    # nee "3..."
    nee "3……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:55
translate chinese ch1ep2_44aca838:

    # nee "2..."
    nee "2……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:56
translate chinese ch1ep2_834f4561:

    # nee "1..."
    nee "1……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:62
translate chinese ch1ep2_9b1f33fa:

    # yt "So after that raid on Hera's safe house, they are making their move just as I thought they would. It didn't even take that long."
    yt "在我们大闹了赫拉的安全屋之后，他们果然像我预料的那样开始行动了。速度甚至还非常快。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:63
translate chinese ch1ep2_e624fa51:

    # yt "Although, I wonder..."
    yt "不过，我很奇怪……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:64
translate chinese ch1ep2_a0e379da:

    # yt "Isn't this guy supposed to be an old hag? What changed?"
    yt "艾妮的未婚夫不应该是个老逼登才对吗？怎么变了？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:65
translate chinese ch1ep2_0325d972:

    # yt "I have a good guess in mind, but I will need concrete answers from Aine."
    yt "我已经有了比较靠谱的猜测，但我还需要从艾妮那里得到准确的答复。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:66
translate chinese ch1ep2_e757e758:

    # yt "First, I need to get rid of this maggot quickly."
    yt "首先，我得赶紧把这个瘟神打发走。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:69
translate chinese ch1ep2_13935f07:

    # yt "[landlady] seems to have detected an unruly presence and is on standby."
    yt "[landlady!t]似乎已经发现了这个不速之客，正在待命了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:70
translate chinese ch1ep2_67372ac5:

    # yt "I'm glad we had that discussion at Beach Island."
    yt "还好我们在沙滩岛上讨论了计划。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:73
translate chinese ch1ep2_ced261ca:

    # mc "If my intuition is right, I'm sure what we did at Hera's safe house alerted whoever is pulling the strings behind her back."
    mc "如果我的直觉没错的话，我们在赫拉的安全屋的所作所为肯定引起了在她背后的那个人的警觉。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:74
translate chinese ch1ep2_2faeb5ca:

    # mc "If so, they'll move sooner than we think. We must be prepared if that happens."
    mc "如果真是这样，他们的行动肯定会比我们想得还要快。我们必须做好准备。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:77
translate chinese ch1ep2_0191d577:

    # mc "I still don't know what they want or their true goal, but I won't let that affect our lives."
    mc "我依然不知道他们想要什么，真正的目标是什么，但我不会让他们影响到我们的生活。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:78
translate chinese ch1ep2_f73d3157:

    # mc "We have people with the right skillsets to do this. I need you to trust me and let me be your brains."
    mc "我们这边的人都身怀绝技，肯定可以做到。我需要你们相信我，让我成为你们的大脑。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:81
translate chinese ch1ep2_ad7dd967:

    # yt "This confirms my hypothesis. Someone's indeed pulling some strings."
    yt "这下我的假设就被证实了。她的背后确实有人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:82
translate chinese ch1ep2_467cdde1:

    # yt "But who?"
    yt "但是会是谁呢？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:83
translate chinese ch1ep2_e42fbdc5:

    # yt "... This tacky son of a bitch?"
    yt "……就是眼前这个下头男？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:84
translate chinese ch1ep2_32398a10:

    # yt "Nah, that person wouldn't be so stupid to show up here blatantly."
    yt "不，那个人才不会这么鲁莽地出现在这里。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:85
translate chinese ch1ep2_d25788fe:

    # yt "If I were pulling the strings, I would try and exhaust my own resources first; and that's what they are doing."
    yt "如果我是幕后黑手，我一定会先用尽手里的资源；这也是他们现在正在做的事。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:86
translate chinese ch1ep2_82a9ae68:

    # yt "I can't carelessly question this guy either since that would only raise his suspicions of me."
    yt "我也不能随意地问这个人各种问题，这只会让他起疑心。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:89
translate chinese ch1ep2_238937bd:

    # yt "However, considering that he got this from his \"sources\" and not on his own, I can exploit that and turn this into a game of denial."
    yt "但是，考虑到他来这里也只是因为“听说”，而不是有确定的消息，我可以利用这一点，矢口否认。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:90
translate chinese ch1ep2_52973eb1:

    # yt "That will open an opportunity to make my move."
    yt "这就让我有机会做出行动。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:124
translate chinese ch1ep2_c912fd96:

    # yt "I can see three scenarios of how I could handle this... Mentz... whatever his name is..."
    yt "我觉得我有三个办法用来应付这位……门泽……鬼记得住他姓什么……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:129
translate chinese ch1ep2_84628c35:

    # yt "First scenario: The good old \"Act of Confusion\"."
    yt "第一个办法：永不过时的“装傻”。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:132
translate chinese ch1ep2_282e5851:

    # mc "What...?"
    mc "啥玩意儿……？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:133
translate chinese ch1ep2_9ab77723:

    # fr "Man, fuck you!"
    fr "去你妈的吧！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:140
translate chinese ch1ep2_d16c8aff:

    # yt "Second scenario: Outsmart him."
    yt "第二个办法：用智慧战胜他。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:143
translate chinese ch1ep2_820e7444:

    # mc "Hm-hmm!"
    mc "哼哼！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:144
translate chinese ch1ep2_9d91e7c4:

    # fr "For real, for real. No cap, on God!"
    fr "有一说一，确实。可不咋地，还真是！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:151
translate chinese ch1ep2_2de2c061:

    # yt "Third scenario: Be aggressive."
    yt "第三个办法：攻击性。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:154
translate chinese ch1ep2_14a82c7c:

    # mc "Fuck off, you son of a bitch!"
    mc "滚回你娘胎里去，操你妈的傻逼东西！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:155
translate chinese ch1ep2_9841a7cb:

    # fr "Say what now?!"
    fr "你说什么？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:162
translate chinese ch1ep2_edc99a5b:

    # yt "I don't want to sound overly suspicious, but whatever scenario I choose, I need to entice him enough to keep coming back here for the plan I have in mind."
    yt "我不想让他太起疑心，但不管我用什么办法，我都得给他足够的理由，让他之后能一次又一次地回来，好让我实行我心里的计划。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:163
translate chinese ch1ep2_06846708:

    # yt "Then, finish him with [landlady]'s grand finale."
    yt "然后，再用[landlady!t]的必杀技终结掉他。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:164
translate chinese ch1ep2_cbbb1bab:

    # yt "If he were at least decent with his approach, I would've probably overlooked the fact that he's a complete twat."
    yt "如果他的态度至少还算恰当，我可能还会忽略他是个彻头彻尾的混蛋这个事实，放他一马。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:165
translate chinese ch1ep2_94cc015b:

    # yt "But instead, my pride tells me I must put this guy in his place."
    yt "但事实恰恰相反，我的自尊心告诉我，我必须给这个家伙一点颜色瞧瞧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:195
translate chinese ch1ep2_af4cc2ca:

    # mc "Um... the... what...?"
    mc "呃……你……什么……？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:196
translate chinese ch1ep2_d715d584:

    # fr "Oh, fuckin' hell... Of course, it would be the deaf servant who welcomes me."
    fr "啊，他妈的……当然了，这家人真是该派一个聋哑人出来迎接我。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:199
translate chinese ch1ep2_f9b346f5:

    # fr "Read my lips, you thick donkey!"
    fr "看我的嘴唇，你这头蠢驴！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:200
translate chinese ch1ep2_9b82ee25:

    # fr "Bring! Me! Aine! Agnor!"
    fr "给我把！艾妮！阿格诺！带来！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:201
translate chinese ch1ep2_d56a6a94:

    # fr "Do you understand me now?"
    fr "现在听懂了吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:204
translate chinese ch1ep2_ae861c9c:

    # mc "I... hold on, I'm still trying to process..."
    mc "我……等一下，我还要再理解一下……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:205
translate chinese ch1ep2_5a78a941:

    # mc "You're Francis... Pretzeloctopus?"
    mc "你是弗朗西斯……普雷泽拉普图斯？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:206
translate chinese ch1ep2_84158ca6:

    # mc "And you're looking for... someone named Aine?"
    mc "然后你是要找……叫艾妮的人？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:207
translate chinese ch1ep2_d34cc292:

    # fr "Hmph, so you {i}can{/i} hear: you're just denser than lead!"
    fr "哼，没想到你还是能听见的啊，只是比猪还笨！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:208
translate chinese ch1ep2_77e14403:

    # fr "Mentzelopoutous, and my relationship with Aine is none of your business!"
    fr "我姓门泽拉普图斯，并且我和艾妮的关系与你无关！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:209
translate chinese ch1ep2_b24a2bec:

    # fr "Fetch her this instant! Do not dare to make me ask again!"
    fr "立刻把她带来！不要让我再问一遍！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:210
translate chinese ch1ep2_0f76af3a:

    # mc "But... uhm... who is she? I've never met this Aine you're looking for."
    mc "但是……呃……她是谁啊？我从来没见过你说的这个叫艾妮的人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:212
translate chinese ch1ep2_3017d42d:

    # fr "Do not waste my time! I was informed she would be here!" with hpunch
    fr "我已经被人告知，她就在这里！" with hpunch

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:213
translate chinese ch1ep2_f874c889:

    # fr "Sincerity dictates that I do not enjoy this state of idleness!"
    fr "不要再浪费无谓的时间！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:236
translate chinese ch1ep2_1bb8ff9a:

    # mc "So, Sir Pretzeloctopus..."
    mc "那个，普雷泽拉普图斯先生……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:237
translate chinese ch1ep2_820a0d19:

    # fr "That's Mentzelopoutous, you uncultured swine!"
    fr "是门泽拉普图斯才对，你这没文化的乡巴佬！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:238
translate chinese ch1ep2_e742239b:

    # mc "Right, Metaloffofus."
    mc "好的，闷做拉屎吐丝。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:240
translate chinese ch1ep2_94a977b5:

    # fr "Hrrr... Why you little...!"
    fr "你……你竟敢……！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:241
translate chinese ch1ep2_9390318c:

    # mc "Anyways, you said you were looking for an Aine Agnor, correct?"
    mc "总之呢，你说你在找一位叫艾妮·阿格诺的人，是吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:242
translate chinese ch1ep2_54b5bfdc:

    # fr "If your ears functioned properly, you would know the answer is {b}\"yes\"{/b}!"
    fr "如果你的耳朵没坏掉的话，你应该就已经知道答案是{b}“是的”{/b}才对！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:243
translate chinese ch1ep2_b29881df:

    # mc "I have never met her, but the fact that you're supposed to marry her means that she must come from wealth, no?"
    mc "我从来没见过她，不过既然你要跟她结婚，那就代表她出身富贵，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:244
translate chinese ch1ep2_5b71ceb5:

    # fr "Yes, I suppose."
    fr "是的，我是这么认为的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:245
translate chinese ch1ep2_2bb2546c:

    # fr "Now hurry and bring her to me! I've already played enough of your games!"
    fr "赶快把她带来见我！我已经受够了！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:246
translate chinese ch1ep2_f874c889_1:

    # fr "Sincerity dictates that I do not enjoy this state of idleness!"
    fr "不要再浪费无谓的时间！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:249
translate chinese ch1ep2_e757d564:

    # mc "That's the thing: there is nobody by that name here."
    mc "可就是这样的：这里没人叫那个名字。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:253
translate chinese ch1ep2_d8ada698:

    # fr "Don't lie to me, boy! I do not take kindly to those that insult my intelligence!"
    fr "不要对我撒谎，小子！我可不会对侮辱我的智商的人客气！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:254
translate chinese ch1ep2_c6de0ed8:

    # mc "Just think about it: does this neighborhood seem like one she would pass through, let alone reside in?"
    mc "你仔细想想：这一带看着像是她那种地位的人会来的地方吗？更别说住下来了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:257
translate chinese ch1ep2_328f26ba:

    # mc "A lovely young lady like her surely would be able to find a living arrangement far more appealing to someone of her status."
    mc "像她那样年轻漂亮，又出身显赫的女生，肯定会找一个跟她的地位更匹配的住处吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:258
translate chinese ch1ep2_8ebe840d:

    # mc "Hell, we even had to wait days for someone to fix our bathtub recently."
    mc "操，我家最近连找人修个浴缸都要等上好几天呢。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:259
translate chinese ch1ep2_478d0c7d:

    # mc "Would this Aine lady live somewhere where she has to go two full days without a functioning bath?"
    mc "这个叫艾妮的小姐会住在一个整整两天都不能用浴缸的地方吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:262
translate chinese ch1ep2_ff5a3190:

    # mc "With all that said, I can assure you that nobody named either Aine or Agnor lives here."
    mc "综上所述，我可以跟你保证，住在这里的人没有叫艾妮的，也没有姓阿格诺的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:263
translate chinese ch1ep2_b2f07e71:

    # mc "I know you said you're in a rush, but you're more than welcome to look around this humble house for yourself if it would make you feel better."
    mc "我知道你赶时间，但假如你需要的话，完全可以进我们的这间小房子里亲自看看。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:264
translate chinese ch1ep2_a4370807:

    # fr "There's no need. I suppose it would be well beneath her to live in this slum."
    fr "不必了。我想她确实不会住在这种贫民窟里。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:265
translate chinese ch1ep2_d9f34199:

    # mc "Hey, now-{w=0.5}{nw}"
    mc "哎，给你个台阶你还真——{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:266
translate chinese ch1ep2_c7db65df:

    # fr "I shall take my leave for now."
    fr "我要走了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:267
translate chinese ch1ep2_e2257ce0:

    # fr "However, if I discover that you lied to my face, then I promise it will be the last lie you’ll ever tell!"
    fr "但是，假如我发现你竟敢当面对我撒谎，那我保证刚刚就是你这辈子最后一次撒谎了！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:290
translate chinese ch1ep2_1ee3cfb4:

    # mc "Hm, so that dick-eating trap of yours does shut sometimes."
    mc "呵，原来你脸上那个专门用来吃鸡巴的洞还是能闭上的啊。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:291
translate chinese ch1ep2_eb188a2a:

    # fr "I beg your pardon?!"
    fr "你说什么？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:292
translate chinese ch1ep2_b65f33eb:

    # mc "I said what I said, pretty boy."
    mc "说了又怎么样啊，小白脸。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:295
translate chinese ch1ep2_4436470e:

    # n "*whispers* Pffft! Haha!"
    n "*低语* 噗哈哈哈！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:296
translate chinese ch1ep2_32fb53c2:

    # a "Hm?"
    a "嗯？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:299
translate chinese ch1ep2_3b2b15b8:

    # mc "You had your turn to speak; now, it's my turn."
    mc "你说完了吧，现在该我说了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:300
translate chinese ch1ep2_a8cb8055:

    # mc "I don't care who the hell you are."
    mc "我不在乎你他妈是哪位。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:301
translate chinese ch1ep2_f41e6a68:

    # mc "You don't come to {i}my{/i} house and threaten anyone."
    mc "你别想跑来{i}我家{/i}，还威胁人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:302
translate chinese ch1ep2_30578796:

    # fr "Threaten?! Who said anything about malicious intent?!"
    fr "威胁？！我有说过任何带有恶意的话吗？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:303
translate chinese ch1ep2_8570a3fe:

    # mc "The fact that you pointed out you're her betrothed yet still can't find her tells me all I need to know about your personality and intentions."
    mc "你明明说了跟她有婚约，却找不到她人在哪，光是这一点就已经足够说明你是个什么人，有什么来意了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:304
translate chinese ch1ep2_cb88167c:

    # mc "First off, I don't know who this Aine person is."
    mc "首先呢，我不知道这个叫艾妮的人是谁。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:305
translate chinese ch1ep2_23fced29:

    # mc "Second, even if she were here, there is no fucking way I'd let you anywhere near her."
    mc "其次，就算她在这里，我他妈也绝对不可能让你靠近她一步。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:306
translate chinese ch1ep2_e33add75:

    # mc "Now use that private school education to figure out what's good for you and get the fuck out of here."
    mc "用你的小学学位好好想想，怎么做对你才算好，抓紧时间走人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:307
translate chinese ch1ep2_e8c052eb:

    # fr "How... dare you speak to me in this manner! You've just made the biggest mistake of your worthless life!"
    fr "你……你竟敢这样对我说话！你刚刚犯下了你这毫无价值的人生里最大的错误！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:310
translate chinese ch1ep2_bd74f856:

    # mc "Then do something about it, Bitchie Billions. I'm right here." with hpunch
    mc "那你倒是动手啊，傻逼富二代。我就在你面前呢。" with hpunch

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:311
translate chinese ch1ep2_f874c889_2:

    # fr "Sincerity dictates that I do not enjoy this state of idleness!"
    fr "不要再浪费无谓的时间！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:312
translate chinese ch1ep2_300fd6be:

    # fr "I'll...! I'll-{w=0.5}{nw}"
    fr "我要……！我要——{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:323
translate chinese ch1ep2_27a3ac3f:

    # fr "I-is someone there?"
    fr "是-是谁？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:326
translate chinese ch1ep2_6a2ce02f:

    # k "FUCK..."
    k "快……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:327
translate chinese ch1ep2_74082eaa:

    # k "OFF..."
    k "滚……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:331
translate chinese ch1ep2_4a820b65:

    # fr "AIEEEEEEEEEEEE!!!!!!"
    fr "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:332
translate chinese ch1ep2_16d8a6b5:

    # fr "S-stay back! D-don't you know who I am?"
    fr "离-离我远点！你-你不知道我是什么人吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:336
translate chinese ch1ep2_06c8daf4:

    # k "{cps=30}Mentzelopoutous... a name unheard of, but thanks to me, it will haunt you forever..."
    k "{cps=30}门泽拉普图斯……没听说过这名字，不过从今往后，这个名字将会成为你的梦魇……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:337
translate chinese ch1ep2_d18dbf48:

    # k "{cps=30}It seems you've been asking the wrong questions, young man."
    k "{cps=30}你好像一直在问错误的问题啊，年轻人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:338
translate chinese ch1ep2_8656e489:

    # k "{cps=30}You should be trembling as you inquire who the hell {i}{b}I{/b}{/i} am."
    k "{cps=30}你该一边颤抖着，一边问{i}{b}我{/b}{/i}是谁才对。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:341
translate chinese ch1ep2_391c8802:

    # k "{cps=30}I am the one whose cursed property you dared to trespass onto with your cheap, imitation Nieman Marcus shoes."
    k "{cps=30}我就是这个你胆敢穿着仿制的尼曼·马库斯牌的便宜鞋子造访的被诅咒的房子的主人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:342
translate chinese ch1ep2_b240359a:

    # k "{cps=30}I am the one who takes pleasure in crushing the skulls of unwelcome guests on my land, regardless of their status or family name."
    k "{cps=30}我就是那个不管来者姓甚名谁，出身如何，只要是不速之客，就要大笑着把他们的头骨砸碎的人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:343
translate chinese ch1ep2_b40cacd4:

    # k "{cps=30}I am the one who will become the ghastly apparition that haunts your every waking moment..."
    k "{cps=30}我就是那个将会让你永无宁日，一生担惊受怕的幽灵……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:346
translate chinese ch1ep2_c759ff8d:

    # k "{cps=30}... And the final vision that consumes your soul if you do not remove your filthy, sycophantic face from my presence in five seconds."
    k "{cps=30}……并且如果在五秒钟之内，我依然能看到你这张肮脏、爱拍马屁的臭脸的话，我就会吞噬掉你的灵魂。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:347
translate chinese ch1ep2_7b673e7a:

    # fr "You-you're bluffing, surely?!"
    fr "你肯-肯定是在虚张声势吧？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:348
translate chinese ch1ep2_d29ecc12:

    # k "{cps=30}Oh? You care to try me, hm?"
    k "{cps=30}哦？你想试试吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:349
translate chinese ch1ep2_c3a70392:

    # fr "..."
    fr "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:350
translate chinese ch1ep2_ad268c4c:

    # k "{cps=30}Five."
    k "{cps=30}五。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:351
translate chinese ch1ep2_8cbfaac7:

    # k "{cps=30}Four."
    k "{cps=30}四。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:352
translate chinese ch1ep2_bab8170a:

    # k "{cps=30}Three."
    k "{cps=30}三。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:355
translate chinese ch1ep2_238d9334:

    # fr "Okay! Okay! Just stay the hell away from me!"
    fr "好吧！好吧！你离我远点！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:360
translate chinese ch1ep2_efa4d71d:

    # k "... The rich ones always flee quickly."
    k "……有钱人总是跑得特别快。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:364
translate chinese ch1ep2_8763f484:

    # k "Good job handling that first interaction, but are you sure we should let him go like that?"
    k "你刚刚的表现很好，不过你确定我们要就这么把他放走吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:365
translate chinese ch1ep2_c9803e0d:

    # k "We could've given him a quick and painless death. Well, maybe not so painless."
    k "我们本来可以给他一个又快又没有痛苦的死亡的。嗯，可能也不是那么无痛吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:368
translate chinese ch1ep2_ad42ef5d:

    # mc "... You're joking, right?"
    mc "……你是在开玩笑，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:371
translate chinese ch1ep2_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:374
translate chinese ch1ep2_bc4f1a33:

    # mc "Right?"
    mc "对吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:377
translate chinese ch1ep2_82091822_1:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:380
translate chinese ch1ep2_88f00735:

    # mc "A-anyway..."
    mc "总-总之……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:381
translate chinese ch1ep2_55d4516d:

    # mc "Let's gather everyone who's here at the moment. We have some important matters to discuss."
    mc "我们把目前在这里的人都召集起来吧。要讨论很重要的事。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:389
translate chinese ch1ep2_da2e61a2:

    # mc "Now that everyone here knows what just happened..."
    mc "现在，大家都知道刚刚发生什么事了……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:390
translate chinese ch1ep2_ad2beb64:

    # mc "Let's hear what you have to say, Aine."
    mc "你有什么要说的，艾妮？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:391
translate chinese ch1ep2_186558f8:

    # a "Why me~? I don't even know what is going on~!"
    a "怎么问我呀~？我根本不知道发生什么了~！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:392
translate chinese ch1ep2_8274eab7:

    # a "It was supposed to be his father, not him~!"
    a "应该是他爸爸，不是他才对~！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:393
translate chinese ch1ep2_2b56732b:

    # a "When? How? Why? I don't know! I didn't approve of anything!"
    a "什么时候？怎么会？为什么？我不知道啊！我什么都没听说！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:394
translate chinese ch1ep2_dc905356:

    # mc "Alright, alright. Calm down and breathe. We won't get anywhere if you're like this."
    mc "好吧，好吧。冷静，深呼吸。你这个样子我们是不会有进展的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:397
translate chinese ch1ep2_f9ba4494:

    # n "Francis is my ex-boyfriend."
    n "弗朗西斯是我的前男友。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:398
translate chinese ch1ep2_2447c87a:

    # mc "Excuse me?"
    mc "你说什么？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:399
translate chinese ch1ep2_205df494:

    # n "I know him fairly well, and I may be able to answer yer questions 'bout him."
    n "我很了解他，说不定可以回答你的问题。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:400
translate chinese ch1ep2_b45988ee:

    # n "But, who are ya people for him to come to this place? What's yer connection with him?"
    n "但是，你们到底是什么人，会让他来登门造访？你们和他有什么联系？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:401
translate chinese ch1ep2_aa2e6d35:

    # n "I haven't seen him for Lord knows how long. And him being here doesn't exactly tickle my fancy."
    n "我已经有天知道多久没见过他了。也根本不喜欢看到他出现在这里。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:402
translate chinese ch1ep2_ec2d8032:

    # n "His condescendin' tone alone is enough to piss me off. And I'm a very patient person."
    n "光是听到他那装腔作势的声音就够惹我生气了。我可是个脾气很好的人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:405
translate chinese ch1ep2_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:406
translate chinese ch1ep2_e5c375ae:

    # k "I'll leave that decision to you."
    k "决定权就交给你了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:409
translate chinese ch1ep2_bc2c6acc:

    # mc "Alright then, listen up."
    mc "好吧，你听我说。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:415
translate chinese ch1ep2_bec7fc2c:

    # "An hour later..."
    "一个小时之后……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:423
translate chinese ch1ep2_17c9884e:

    # mc "We are still trying to locate my [landlord]'s whereabouts, but that's all we've been through."
    mc "我们目前还在找我[landlord!t]到底在哪，不过目前为止的所有事我都已经告诉你了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:424
translate chinese ch1ep2_cadfc24f:

    # n "Okay, so count me in."
    n "好的，那我也加入。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:425
translate chinese ch1ep2_bc9eef2a:

    # mc "I'm sorry, what?"
    mc "不好意思，什么？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:426
translate chinese ch1ep2_a8036dca:

    # n "I told ya, he's my ex, and I can help ya make him rack off."
    n "我说了，他是我前任，我可以帮你让他滚蛋。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:427
translate chinese ch1ep2_579db565:

    # mc "Yeah, you are exes, but you don't have to get involved with us."
    mc "是啊，他是你前任，但你没必要牵扯进我们的事情里来啊。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:428
translate chinese ch1ep2_70fce3b3:

    # n "What happened between us is already behind me. I have my reason for wantin' to do this."
    n "我们两个之前的恩怨我已经不在意了。我想加入是有我自己的原因。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:429
translate chinese ch1ep2_2ca17e21:

    # mc "And... that is?"
    mc "什么……原因？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:432
translate chinese ch1ep2_980a7fba:

    # n "I'm sure yer assumin' it by now, but Francis is a playboy."
    n "我想你肯定也已经猜到了，弗朗西斯是个花花公子。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:433
translate chinese ch1ep2_a41e0c07:

    # n "Sure, he's an idiot, but he's a dangerous bloke once he means things."
    n "他的确是个蠢货，不过他认真起来的时候，也会变成一个危险的家伙。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:434
translate chinese ch1ep2_a91338bb:

    # e "Aine and I can vouch for that."
    e "是的，我和艾妮都可以作证。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:435
translate chinese ch1ep2_5693a819:

    # mc "Huh..."
    mc "嚯……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:438
translate chinese ch1ep2_321b4700:

    # n "I discovered that after several weeks of being in a relationship with him, and so... I broke up with him shortly after."
    n "我和他交往几个星期之后，才发现这事，所以……很快就跟他分手了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:439
translate chinese ch1ep2_365e0b60:

    # n "Frustrated with my decision, he fired my old man who was doin' work for him as retaliation."
    n "他非常生气，我爸爸又正好在他家手底下工作，他就把我爸开除了，当做是对我的报复。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:440
translate chinese ch1ep2_74fd84cb:

    # n "Our lives went downhill as he continued to spite my family and me whenever he had the chance."
    n "他之后还一有机会就给我们家添堵，所以我们的生活也每况愈下。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:441
translate chinese ch1ep2_66cbea4d:

    # n "However, we were fortunate enough to recover from all that on our own when we moved to the countryside, away from his wrath."
    n "但是，我们很幸运，在搬到乡下之后，慢慢地恢复过来了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:442
translate chinese ch1ep2_c5b69d28:

    # n "Now, I have a chance to return the favour, and I simply can't live knowin' that he could be lurkin' around these parts."
    n "我现在有机会报复回去了，而且我知道了他可能会对你们不利，没法坐视不管。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:443
translate chinese ch1ep2_00c32e89:

    # mc "That's quite a concise explanation for something very horrible..."
    mc "这么糟糕的事情，你的解释还真简洁明了……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:446
translate chinese ch1ep2_e2b471fd:

    # n "I told ya I'm a straightforward person, mate."
    n "我说了，我是个直来直去的人，伙计。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:447
translate chinese ch1ep2_d7fb5fd1:

    # n "I hate creatin' drama, so if I have something to tell or ask from ya, I'll lay it out in one sentence if I can."
    n "我很烦给自己加戏，所以我要是有事告诉你，或者求你，我都会尽量用一句话搞定。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:450
translate chinese ch1ep2_5981f7f2:

    # mc "Uhh... Gwen?"
    mc "呃……格温？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:451
translate chinese ch1ep2_4b340443:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:454
translate chinese ch1ep2_bb2cf764:

    # n "..."
    n "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:457
translate chinese ch1ep2_974dd886:

    # n "I won't look away just because yer older, ya know?"
    n "我可不会因为你比我大就把视线挪走。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:460
translate chinese ch1ep2_dbe0fe5a:

    # g "I like her."
    g "我喜欢她。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:463
translate chinese ch1ep2_14ae5cc4:

    # mc "Then how about you two? How do you know him?"
    mc "那你们两个呢？你们怎么认识他的？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:466
translate chinese ch1ep2_76c4395b:

    # a "Well..."
    a "这个……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:467
translate chinese ch1ep2_9ecbd0c3:

    # a "Emma and I have known him since middle school."
    a "我和艾玛从初中就认识他了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:470
translate chinese ch1ep2_86008028:

    # e "He was one of those boys who sought Aine's attention. The first one, in fact."
    e "他就是那些总爱吸引艾妮的注意力的男生之一。实际上是第一个那么做的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:471
translate chinese ch1ep2_eabc0976:

    # e "There were too many, so we gave them nicknames. Hence him being \"Schoolboy A\"."
    e "人数实在太多了，所以我们就给他们起外号。于是他就成了“A同学”。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:474
translate chinese ch1ep2_543ff658:

    # n "Bloody hell, lass! I know yer quite the beauty and all, but I didn't know ya had heaps of suitors!"
    n "我去啊，姑娘！我知道你是个大美人，但是没想到会有那么多人跟你求爱啊！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:475
translate chinese ch1ep2_3450116b:

    # a "*sighs* They never became my suitors. I just turned them all down."
    a "*叹气* 什么求爱啊。我把他们全都拒绝了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:476
translate chinese ch1ep2_2f7a50c4:

    # a "And having my family name over my head acted like an insect repellent no matter how little..."
    a "而且我家里的名声多多少少也让他们有些忌惮……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:477
translate chinese ch1ep2_e14f64a8:

    # a "But I have no idea when this all came to be. Mother didn't even mention anything about it when we were there."
    a "但是我不知道怎么会变成现在这样。妈妈从来没提到过。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:478
translate chinese ch1ep2_45facb5c:

    # a "I'm so confused right now..."
    a "我现在什么都想不明白了……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:481
translate chinese ch1ep2_fad21ee8:

    # mc "You were forced into marriage, to begin with. There's nothing new about it."
    mc "你从一开始就被安排了婚事，这没什么新鲜的啊。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:482
translate chinese ch1ep2_1224df9d:

    # a "That's not the point!"
    a "那不是重点！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:483
translate chinese ch1ep2_b8c897db:

    # yt "What's on your mind this time, Hera? Is this what you really want?"
    yt "你又在打什么算盘了，赫拉？这是你真正想要的吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:484
translate chinese ch1ep2_d2869c6c:

    # mc "Ugh... Why can't old people simply say what they want?"
    mc "唉……为什么这群大人就不能把话说明白点呢？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:489
translate chinese ch1ep2_c185f7aa:

    # g "Whoa!" (multiple=2)
    g "哇啊！" (multiple=2)

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:490
translate chinese ch1ep2_b134584d:

    # mc "Eek!" (multiple=2)
    mc "啊！" (multiple=2)

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:498
translate chinese ch1ep2_93e0a302:

    # k "I told you, we could've just ended his miserable life..."
    k "我都说了，我们本来可以结束他那可悲的生命的……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:499
translate chinese ch1ep2_8f27efce:

    # k "Bury his decaying remains six feet deep in the backyard, where the worms will feast on his flesh. Or even better, entomb him in the basement, left to molder in darkness..."
    k "把他腐烂的尸体埋进后院里六英尺深的地方，让虫子们饱餐一顿。或者用个更好的办法，把他丢进地下室里，在黑暗中腐烂……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:500
translate chinese ch1ep2_a61868a4:

    # k "Then we can savor the sight of his body being devoured by maggots, cannibalized by his own kind, as we indulge in wine, the putrid stench only serving to enhance the experience..."
    k "然后我们就可以欣赏他的尸体被蛆虫，也就是他的同类尽情啃食，我们在一旁喝美酒庆祝，腐臭的气味只会让这种体验更加迷人……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:501
translate chinese ch1ep2_c1b20e1b:

    # k "No prying eyes nor cameras shall pierce this shadowy realm; I'll guarantee that no one ever discovers our secret..."
    k "没有旁人的目光，或是相机，能穿透这阴暗的领域；我保证，不会有人能发现我们的秘密……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:502
translate chinese ch1ep2_f61a1cbf:

    # k "Absolutely no one..."
    k "绝对不会有人发现……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:503
translate chinese ch1ep2_0f737532:

    # k "Our twisted secret will be forever locked away, hidden in the depths of our wicked souls..."
    k "我们这扭曲的秘密会永远被封存起来，隐藏在我们邪恶的灵魂里……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:506
translate chinese ch1ep2_12519584:

    # s "Uhm... [landlady], are you okay...?"
    s "呃……[landlady!t]，你没事吧……？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:510
translate chinese ch1ep2_d3fbc217:

    # k "Yep! Perfectly fine, my dear!"
    k "是的！我好得很，亲爱的！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:511
translate chinese ch1ep2_e1904331:

    # mc "Phew!"
    mc "吓死我了！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:520
translate chinese ch1ep2_e9f70e0d:

    # mc "So... I assume you have a plan, then?"
    mc "那……我想你已经有计划了？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:521
translate chinese ch1ep2_b89b00f4:

    # n "I know his most vulnerable Achilles heel."
    n "我知道他最致命的弱点。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:522
translate chinese ch1ep2_1774f102:

    # n "Women, especially me."
    n "那就是女人，特别是我。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:523
translate chinese ch1ep2_721ddb12:

    # mc "You?"
    mc "你？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:524
translate chinese ch1ep2_431b3bd1:

    # n "He was extremely frustrated when I broke up with him, and I know he still hasn't moved on from it."
    n "我和他分手的时候，他特别生气，而且我知道他到现在也没走出来。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:525
translate chinese ch1ep2_c63407f8:

    # n "Or maybe he did, but I'll put money on it."
    n "也可能他还真放下了，但我敢赌他没有。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:526
translate chinese ch1ep2_c15da38f:

    # n "I've been wantin' to do this for a long time, but I couldn't for personal reasons."
    n "我想这么做已经很久了，但是因为个人的原因没法出手。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:527
translate chinese ch1ep2_dff7aa2c:

    # n "Now, however... maybe I can."
    n "但是，现在……我说不定就可以了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:528
translate chinese ch1ep2_f4be4a21:

    # n "But for this to work, we need a build-up, and he needs to come back here."
    n "但是要想实行计划，我们得做好准备，他也必须回来一趟。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:529
translate chinese ch1ep2_7dbdcb38:

    # mc "*chuckles* It seems we have the same thing in mind."
    mc "*轻笑* 看来我们想到一块去了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:549
translate chinese ch1ep2_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:550
