    # m "Sorry, I didn't mention where I'd be waiting."
    m "对不起，我没说我在哪等你。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:887
translate chinese ch1ep2_b5b4182f:

    # mc "You're lucky I know the academy well."
    mc "我对这里很熟，算你走运。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:892
translate chinese ch1ep2_514f7946:

    # mc "Man... it's not going to stop soon, is it?"
    mc "天啊……这雨一时半会停不了了吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:893
translate chinese ch1ep2_46454de8:

    # m "I don't think so..."
    m "恐怕是的……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:894
translate chinese ch1ep2_02647b1e:

    # m "Night students can stay until eleven, don't worry."
    m "没事的，晚上有课的学生可以待到11点。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:897
translate chinese ch1ep2_5f425201:

    # mc "Yeah. Luckily, the guards still know me."
    mc "是啊。很走运，门卫还认识我。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:898
translate chinese ch1ep2_1f41a3b3:

    # m "Oh?"
    m "哦？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:899
translate chinese ch1ep2_7b318521:

    # mc "I attend the alumni gathering every year, so..."
    mc "我每年都会参加校友聚会，所以……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:902
translate chinese ch1ep2_ef6dfa9c:

    # m "I see."
    m "是这样啊。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:903
translate chinese ch1ep2_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:906
translate chinese ch1ep2_6a11d2fb:

    # mc "Were you just waiting for me to come, or did you remember something?"
    mc "你是只是在等我来，还是又想起什么了？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:907
translate chinese ch1ep2_0d124ebd:

    # m "*chuckles* And yet, you came within seconds."
    m "*轻笑* 你还是不到几秒就来了。你办事一向很快……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:908
translate chinese ch1ep2_1c5cf061:

    # yt "... I'm not sure if she intended that to sound sexual, or if I'm just that curious about what she might do again."
    yt "……我不知道她是故意开黄腔，还是说我只是太好奇她可能再做些什么了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:913
translate chinese ch1ep2_0fd0fe36:

    # mc "Really? Did that happen last time too?"
    mc "真的吗？上次也是这样吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:914
translate chinese ch1ep2_0fb9cb93:

    # m "Yeah, I was caught off guard and told you I was sleeping instead."
    m "是啊，我当时被吓到了，于是骗你说我在睡觉。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:915
translate chinese ch1ep2_8d52b587:

    # mc "I'm quite curious about you, you know?"
    mc "我对你可是好奇得很。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:919
translate chinese ch1ep2_a4208fd3:

    # mc "I don't usually come within seconds. So, I'm not that weak, you know?"
    mc "我一般来说不会在几秒钟之内就完事。我可没那么弱哦？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:922
translate chinese ch1ep2_a596aff2:

    # m "You're quick on the uptake, Commander..."
    m "你理解得很快，指挥官……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:923
translate chinese ch1ep2_687474a7:

    # m "I honestly didn't expect you'd get that one. You're curious, aren't you?"
    m "我真的没想到你能听出来。你很好奇，是吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:924
translate chinese ch1ep2_81c2b8ef:

    # mc "In more ways than one."
    mc "我在好几个方面都很好奇。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:925
translate chinese ch1ep2_0767d418:

    # m "Hmmmm..."
    m "嗯……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:926
translate chinese ch1ep2_ed8787e6:

    # mc "On a serious note, I'm {i}really{/i} curious about you."
    mc "不过认真地说，我{i}真的{/i}对你很好奇。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:930
translate chinese ch1ep2_e5d63887:

    # mc "Ever since that clash between you and Emma, and with what [landlady] said after that, it never left my mind."
    mc "自从那天你和艾玛起了冲突，[landlady!t]又跟我说了那些话以来，我就一直在想那些。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:931
translate chinese ch1ep2_547d388e:

    # mc "Furthermore, you're the type of person who could appear strange to some."
    mc "而且，你还是那种对一些人来说很奇怪的类型。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:932
translate chinese ch1ep2_e7b9999e:

    # mc "You appear in the most unexpected ways. You do and say things out of the blue."
    mc "你总是能用最让人想不到的方式出现。你总是毫无征兆地说话，做事。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:933
translate chinese ch1ep2_471924d0:

    # mc "Who are you? Where did you come from, Moon Chi?"
    mc "你是谁？你到底是从哪来的，气月？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:936
translate chinese ch1ep2_e923c430:

    # m "Would you listen if I told you?"
    m "我跟你说的话，你会听吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:937
translate chinese ch1ep2_e6f06ff4:

    # mc "You bet I would. You've given me more than enough clues to be interested in the mystery that is you."
    mc "我当然会听。你给我留下了那么多暗示，我早就对你身上的谜团很感兴趣了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:938
translate chinese ch1ep2_aa88ed83:

    # mc "Of course, only if it's alright for you to talk about it."
    mc "当然，是在你愿意告诉我的情况下。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:942
translate chinese ch1ep2_e612037c_2:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:943
translate chinese ch1ep2_13bccaf8:

    # m "Let's take a walk."
    m "我们一起走走吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:944
translate chinese ch1ep2_874bcee0:

    # yt "Where on the moon's surface was she hiding her hair?"
    yt "她把她的头发都藏哪去了？月亮上吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:945
translate chinese ch1ep2_686a19d0:

    # yt "*chuckles* \"Apply some 69 on me\", nice!"
    yt "*轻笑* “给我来点69”，挺好！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:956
translate chinese ch1ep2_080b2cdf:

    # m "My name wasn't Moon, and my last name was never Chi."
    m "我的名字不是月，我也从来不姓气。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:957
translate chinese ch1ep2_05500ff6:

    # mc "Huh?"
    mc "啊？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:960
translate chinese ch1ep2_9b508908:

    # m "My name used to be Lee Ha-Jeong."
    m "我以前的名字是李赫贞。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:964
translate chinese ch1ep2_de867042:

    # mf "There she is, just like we discussed in our deal."
    mf "就是她了，跟我们说好的一样。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:967
translate chinese ch1ep2_a38e3607:

    # mil "Can you walk?"
    mil "你能走路吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:968
translate chinese ch1ep2_e612037c_3:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:969
translate chinese ch1ep2_972cc629:

    # mil "I'll take that as a no."
    mil "那就应该是不能走了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:973
translate chinese ch1ep2_77f3c0de:

    # mf "And my money?"
    mf "我的钱呢？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:979
translate chinese ch1ep2_931c9464:

    # mf "Make sure I never see her again!"
    mf "可千万别再让我看见她！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:980
translate chinese ch1ep2_f97c3db1:

    # mil "..."
    mil "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:981
translate chinese ch1ep2_4fc98f45:

    # mil "Trust me."
    mil "相信我吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:982
translate chinese ch1ep2_56751554:

    # mil "You won't."
    mil "你再也不会看见她了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:985
translate chinese ch1ep2_466f212c:

    # mf "This never happened, Sergeant!"
    mf "别人要是问起来，我们可从来没见过面，军爷！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:989
translate chinese ch1ep2_40773ec9:

    # m "Amidst their war against Sha Crea, I was sold by my father to Glabia's military when I was twelve years old."
    m "我十二岁的时候，格拉比亚和沙克雷亚正在打仗，我被我爸爸卖给了格拉比亚的军队。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:990
translate chinese ch1ep2_b83b6b93:

    # m "But I couldn't care less about what would happen to me."
    m "但我根本不在乎我会变成什么样子。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:991
translate chinese ch1ep2_19a889ef:

    # m "I thought it might be a chance. I thought it was fine as long as I didn't end up in a slave market."
    m "我还以为那是我的机会。我以为只要我不被送到奴隶市场去就算好了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:992
translate chinese ch1ep2_f0dbb2a1:

    # mc "That's... fucked up..."
    mc "这也……太乱套了……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:993
translate chinese ch1ep2_d7067d7d:

    # mc "W-why? How can he just..."
    mc "为-为什么？他怎么能做出这种事来……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:996
translate chinese ch1ep2_e5311099:

    # m "He wasn't my biological father."
    m "他不是我的亲生父亲。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:997
translate chinese ch1ep2_a34ea0c1:

    # m "He said he picked me up somewhere but never told me where or who my real parents were."
    m "他说我是捡来的，也从来没说过我的亲生父母是谁。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:998
translate chinese ch1ep2_4c6bdb86:

    # m "Glabia was in such desperate need of manpower to the point where they'd go as far as how they enlisted me."
    m "格拉比亚当时急缺兵力，已经窘迫到了连我这种人都能入伍的地步。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:999
translate chinese ch1ep2_026200ad:

    # mc "If they needed military force, why someone as young as you? I don't get it."
    mc "就算他们需要征兵，应该也不会要像你那样年纪那么小的小孩子吧？我不懂他们在搞什么。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1002
translate chinese ch1ep2_e09eab10:

    # m "Well, the {i}me{/i} as you see now..."
    m "实际上，你现在看到的{i}我{/i}……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1003
translate chinese ch1ep2_42c09bb3:

    # m "... Isn't really me, or who I was back then."
    m "……并不是真正的我，或者说是当时的我。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1004
translate chinese ch1ep2_e5a4e096:

    # mc "What?! I'm so confused!"
    mc "什么？！我更听不明白了！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1005
translate chinese ch1ep2_d170a85c:

    # m "I have no idea what they did to me. All I know is that it involved science or experiments with the human body."
    m "我不知道他们对我做了什么。我只知道是某种人体实验。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1006
translate chinese ch1ep2_347be071:

    # m "They said the younger you are, the higher your body's chance to endure the procedure."
    m "他们说越年轻的人越有机会能承受住那种实验。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1007
translate chinese ch1ep2_63099ab6:

    # mc "What the hell..."
    mc "什么鬼啊……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1011
translate chinese ch1ep2_832b2b0e:

    # m "When I woke up, I felt different... stronger..."
    m "我醒来之后，感觉很不一样……变强壮了……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1012
translate chinese ch1ep2_9ba29abb:

    # m "A lot stronger than my tiny body could handle... It felt like I could do anything."
    m "那种强大的力量，根本不属于我瘦小的身体……就好像是我无所不能一样。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1013
translate chinese ch1ep2_9ccfefa4:

    # m "Then, I realized that it wasn't me anymore. My consciousness was somehow just entombed inside this new body."
    m "那之后，我才发现，我已经不是我了。只是我的意识被装进了一个新的身体。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1014
translate chinese ch1ep2_928311a9:

    # m "Honestly, I was glad..."
    m "其实，我很高兴……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1015
translate chinese ch1ep2_044bc307:

    # m "That body filled with diseases was gone..."
    m "能够摆脱以前那个百病缠身的身体……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1016
translate chinese ch1ep2_8c21b4e8:

    # m "However..."
    m "但是……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1019
translate chinese ch1ep2_4e11b0c3:

    # mil "What is your name?"
    mil "你叫什么？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1020
translate chinese ch1ep2_26668f7b:

    # m "Lee Ha-Jeong..."
    m "李赫贞……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1021
translate chinese ch1ep2_2d684d90:

    # mil "Do you remember everything before you came here?"
    mil "你还记得你来这里以前的事吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1022
translate chinese ch1ep2_8cb62253:

    # m "Yes."
    m "记得。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1023
translate chinese ch1ep2_90cd295a:

    # mil "Good. This proves you are one of the successful subjects."
    mil "很好。这代表你是个成功的实验体。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1026
translate chinese ch1ep2_c4738009:

    # m "Successful... subjects...?"
    m "成功……实验体……？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1027
translate chinese ch1ep2_7c484afc:

    # mil "From now on, Lee Ha-Jeong is no longer of this world."
    mil "从今往后，李赫贞就不存在于这个世界了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1028
translate chinese ch1ep2_4f81d78f:

    # mil "That person didn't exist, nor was she ever born."
    mil "那个人没有存在过，根本没有出生过。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1029
translate chinese ch1ep2_263ead34:

    # mil "You shall be called... {b}\"Subject Number Four\"{/b}."
    mil "你的称谓就是……{b}“四号实验体”{/b}。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1030
translate chinese ch1ep2_c772f1c3:

    # mil "You are nothing but a weapon. A tool to help us win this war."
    mil "你只是个单纯的兵器。是帮我们打赢这场战争的工具。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1031
translate chinese ch1ep2_6d5bf563:

    # mil "Glabia's military now owns you. You don't have any freedom until you've served your purpose."
    mil "现在你是属于格拉比亚军队的财产了。在你完成使命之前，都不会有任何自由。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1032
translate chinese ch1ep2_c7b14b44:

    # mil "And that is to die fighting for his territory."
    mil "而你的使命就是为了国家，在战场上捐躯。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1033
translate chinese ch1ep2_e612037c_4:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1036
translate chinese ch1ep2_e9c930fb:

    # mil "I'm under your squad. Let's enjoy our time here while we are still alive, yeah?"
    mil "我在你的小队里。趁我们还活着，就活得自在点，好吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1039
translate chinese ch1ep2_2acbc28a:

    # mil "Unlike you, I'm nothing but a normal human being, so don't mind me trying to act all high and mighty once in a while."
    mil "我跟你不一样，只是个普通人。所以还请你别介意我偶尔在你面前装个逼。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1040
translate chinese ch1ep2_b0716631:

    # mil "I'll be in your care, {i}Captain Number Four{/i}."
    mil "之后我就归你管了，{i}四号队长{/i}。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1044
translate chinese ch1ep2_f03d0a86:

    # m "The existence I entered into... was even worse."
    m "之后发生的事……糟糕透顶。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1045
translate chinese ch1ep2_df088fe2:

    # m "I killed hundreds against my own will. I was in a war I shouldn't have been fighting."
    m "我被逼着杀了很多人。被逼着打一场与我无关的战争。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1046
translate chinese ch1ep2_d62cea6b:

    # m "I was nothing but a child without any other purpose but to offer my life for something I barely understood."
    m "我只是个小孩子，没有任何目标，只能为了我几乎没法理解的东西赌上性命。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1047
translate chinese ch1ep2_0af25d81:

    # m "I wasn't fighting for Glabia's glory. I was fighting to survive."
    m "我不是在为了格拉比亚的荣誉而战。我是为了活下去而战。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1048
translate chinese ch1ep2_f36c4041:

    # m "Many of my friends tried to escape from the military. Yet no one ever did succeed."
    m "我的很多朋友都想从军队里逃跑。但是没有一个人成功。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1049
translate chinese ch1ep2_2e328a0b:

    # m "They all either died or were captured and detained for months with barely any water or food."
    m "他们要么是死了，要么就被抓了回来，连关几个月禁闭，中间几乎不给任何水和食物。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1052
translate chinese ch1ep2_05ecb406:

    # m "When the war finally came to an end, someone came to me and offered help to gain my freedom."
    m "等到了战争终于结束的时候，突然出现了一个人，说要帮我重获自由。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1053
translate chinese ch1ep2_6d9453ae:

    # m "She told me to take my friends with me, but they all had lost hope..."
    m "她跟我说，让我带上朋友一起，但他们全都失去希望了……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1054
translate chinese ch1ep2_bcf0d44a:

    # m "Except for my two closest friends..."
    m "除了我最亲密的两个朋友……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1055
translate chinese ch1ep2_4ed087e6:

    # m "Subjects Number Six and Eight..."
    m "实验体六号和八号……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1059
translate chinese ch1ep2_1d6e1422:

    # mc "Did they..."
    mc "他们难道……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1060
translate chinese ch1ep2_ac3afacd:

    # m "Mhm."
    m "嗯。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1061
translate chinese ch1ep2_53cfb0bc:

    # m "We were about to cross the border, but they were followed."
    m "我们马上就要穿过边境线的时候，追兵来了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1062
translate chinese ch1ep2_13771bf9:

    # m "... Six was shot in front of me, and Eight..."
    m "……六号在我眼前中了一枪，而八号……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1078
translate chinese ch1ep2_bdef24d4:

    # eg "Four!"
    eg "四号！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1079
translate chinese ch1ep2_10c78244:

    # eg "No, Moon! Listen to me!"
    eg "不，月！听我说！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1080
translate chinese ch1ep2_3b167059:

    # eg "You need to run!"
    eg "你快跑！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1081
translate chinese ch1ep2_de238c83:

    # m "What?!"
    m "什么？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1083
translate chinese ch1ep2_40e156b7:

    # eg "That's Number Two with her goddamn sniper rifle, Four! She's the only one with that kind of aim in this environment!"
    eg "开枪的人是二号，那个狙击手啊，四号！只有她在这种环境里才能打这么准！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1084
translate chinese ch1ep2_57800442:

    # eg "I'm sure she followed me and Six, and if the rest of Loyalists are with her, they will be here soon!"
    eg "我和六号肯定被她跟踪了，要是其他忠诚派也跟来了的话，肯定马上就到了！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1085
translate chinese ch1ep2_fa7ca2b9:

    # eg "No matter how much of a special subject you are, we will still be outnumbered!"
    eg "不管你是个多特殊的实验体，都打不过那么多人的！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1086
translate chinese ch1ep2_2977b800:

    # eg "I'll distract Two and give you enough time to run!"
    eg "我去引开二号，你抓紧时间逃跑！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1087
translate chinese ch1ep2_d4888601:

    # m "I will not leave you behind, Eight! Six is already-"
    m "我不会抛下你的，八号！六号已经——"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1090
translate chinese ch1ep2_664d7933:

    # eg "Unlike me, you and Six had real dreams! So it's alright if I die here in exchange for your freedom, Four!"
    eg "你和六号跟我不一样，你们有真正的梦想！我愿意死在这换来你的自由，四号！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1091
translate chinese ch1ep2_d1adb82e:

    # eg "Go!"
    eg "快走！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1092
translate chinese ch1ep2_f976bb4b:

    # eg "Run, and don't look back!"
    eg "跑吧，不要回头！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1093
translate chinese ch1ep2_39b4a2a3:

    # eg "Find that purpose you were talking about! And promise me you'll use the name Six gave to you! That's all I ask!"
    eg "去找到你真正目的吧！用六号给你的名字！我只求你这些了！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1096
translate chinese ch1ep2_3b3a387f:

    # m "*hics*"
    m "*抽泣*"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1100
translate chinese ch1ep2_b0141541:

    # eg "STOP CRYING AND RUN! THAT'S A FUCKING ORDER!"
    eg "{b}别哭了，快跑！这是我的命令！{/b}"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1107
translate chinese ch1ep2_1e227034:

    # eg "RAAAAAAHHHHHH!{w=2.0}{nw}"
    eg "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！{w=2.0}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1111
translate chinese ch1ep2_9bbf683a:

    # m "*gasps*"
    m "*惊讶*"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1114
translate chinese ch1ep2_1b2267b9:

    # eg "R-run..."
    eg "快-快走……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1115
translate chinese ch1ep2_ae1750e2:

    # eg "Don't... stop..."
    eg "别……停下……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1116
translate chinese ch1ep2_7fb2ae20:

    # eg "For all of us... who have... and will die in this hell..."
    eg "为了我们所有已经……和将要死在这个地狱里的人……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1119
translate chinese ch1ep2_9d033b56:

    # eg "Survive... and live..."
    eg "好好……活下去……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1124
translate chinese ch1ep2_ed05c2c3:

    # m "She sacrificed herself for me."
    m "她为了我牺牲了自己。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1125
translate chinese ch1ep2_cb924b22:

    # m "I could still hear her last words fade away as I ran for my life."
    m "我逃走的时候，依然还能听到她最后的话语慢慢消散。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1126
translate chinese ch1ep2_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1129
translate chinese ch1ep2_acb887f4:

    # m "If not for their support, I would've killed myself long ago. It was thanks to them that I'm here."
    m "如果不是有她们的陪伴，我早就自杀了。我能有今天，完全都是归功于她们。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1130
translate chinese ch1ep2_a6ed4f97:

    # m "I wanted to go back for their bodies and at least give them a proper burial, but..."
    m "我有想过回去找到她们的尸体，好好安葬，但是……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1131
translate chinese ch1ep2_e612037c_5:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1132
translate chinese ch1ep2_06a51113:

    # m "Now, I can't even cry to mourn their deaths every year on the day when I lost them."
    m "我现在甚至没法在她们的忌日哭出来，为她们哀悼。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1133
translate chinese ch1ep2_0e9013c7:

    # mc "Why is that?"
    mc "为什么？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1136
translate chinese ch1ep2_8b455ebd:

    # m "Whatever the military did to me has had a slow side effect on my body."
    m "军方在我身上做的实验有缓慢的副作用。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1137
translate chinese ch1ep2_21eec35a:

    # m "It eventually killed my tear glands, and my eyes started malfunctioning."
    m "我的泪腺完全坏死了，眼睛也出了毛病。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1138
translate chinese ch1ep2_80ab0af4:

    # mc "That's why you're always wearing glasses..."
    mc "所以你才一直戴着眼镜……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1139
translate chinese ch1ep2_ac3afacd_1:

    # m "Mhm."
    m "嗯。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1140
translate chinese ch1ep2_285b5214:

    # m "If I get too emotional, blood comes out instead of tears. Then a sharp, excruciating pain in my eyes follows soon after."
    m "要是我哭了，流出来的就不是眼泪，而是血。然后我的眼睛也会剧痛。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1141
translate chinese ch1ep2_e1339acf:

    # m "So I avoid crying even if I want to..."
    m "所以我哪怕想哭，也不能哭……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1142
translate chinese ch1ep2_4a8562a8:

    # yt "Being unable to cry is something I've never heard before. But I can't imagine the pain she has to endure by constantly holding herself back."
    yt "我从来没有听说过有人居然会失去哭的能力。但是她忍了这么久，一定经受过巨大的痛苦。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1143
translate chinese ch1ep2_e2f68db1:

    # mc "How were you... able to escape from that place?"
    mc "你是怎么……从那里跑出来的？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1146
translate chinese ch1ep2_64d91354:

    # m "I don't know."
    m "我不知道。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1147
translate chinese ch1ep2_6403d913:

    # mc "Wait, you... you don't know?"
    mc "什么，你……你不知道？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1152
translate chinese ch1ep2_b50293d7:

    # m "I was filled with adrenaline and had no idea how long I was at it, but I kept on running again and again."
    m "我当时全身充满了肾上腺素，一直跑，一直跑，不知道跑了多久。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1153
translate chinese ch1ep2_c7b55f6d:

    # m "Last thing I know, I fell and lost consciousness."
    m "最后我摔倒了，失去了意识。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1167
translate chinese ch1ep2_95712847:

    # m "When I opened my eyes..."
    m "我再把眼睛睁开的时候……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1174
translate chinese ch1ep2_132d63c9:

    # m "... What I saw was freedom spread out before me."
    m "……眼前只有广袤无垠的自由。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1181
translate chinese ch1ep2_a529ac16:

    # m "I thought that if there was such thing as fate, I could only laugh at how cruel it was."
    m "我想，如果命运真的存在的话，那它的残酷只能让我发笑。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1185
translate chinese ch1ep2_368531c5:

    # m "And at that moment, I promised myself that I would keep living for both Six and Eight's sake."
    m "那个时候，我发誓，一定要为了六号和八号好好活下去。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1190
translate chinese ch1ep2_aee6a38f:

    # m "Later, uncle found me lying on that beach and happily took me in. However, what boggles my mind is that..."
    m "之后，叔叔发现了我躺在沙滩上，很开心地收养了我。但是，我有个地方却想不通……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1191
translate chinese ch1ep2_1d13af56:

    # mc "Glabia territory is in another country."
    mc "格拉比亚跟这里离了十万八千里。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1192
translate chinese ch1ep2_857b34c3:

    # m "That's right."
    m "是的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1193
translate chinese ch1ep2_fa417641:

    # m "How I got out and got here is still a mystery today."
    m "我到底是怎么逃出来的，又怎么到了这里，至今也是个谜。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1194
translate chinese ch1ep2_1c5d5a14:

    # mc "If you think about it, it's just... impossible."
    mc "仔细想想，确实……根本不可能啊。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1203
translate chinese ch1ep2_dee59cad:

    # m "*chuckles* Maybe I was meant to find you."
    m "*轻笑* 可能我命中注定要遇见你。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1204
translate chinese ch1ep2_3eadb99d:

    # m "Because before you came into my life, I had nothing."
    m "因为在遇到你之前，我什么都没有。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1205
translate chinese ch1ep2_92631bd7:

    # m "However, lately..."
    m "但是，最近……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1208
translate chinese ch1ep2_f9792bae:

    # m "It's so much fun whenever you are around~!"
    m "只要有你在，一切都很开心~！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1209
translate chinese ch1ep2_e36de39e:

    # yt "She's a simple girl with nothing but a simple wish."
    yt "她是个单纯的女生，只有一个简单的愿望。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1210
translate chinese ch1ep2_1f9124b5:

    # yt "To find where she belongs. Her purpose."
    yt "那就是找到她属于哪里。找到她的目的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1211
translate chinese ch1ep2_1f9cf905:

    # yt "She wasn't kidding when she said she's like Emma. The only difference is that, unlike Emma, she has nowhere to go."
    yt "她说她和艾玛很像，倒不是在开玩笑。唯一的区别在于，她和艾玛不一样，她已经没有归宿了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1212
translate chinese ch1ep2_a6abbac4:

    # m "I'm not sure if you are the purpose I'm looking for."
    m "我不知道你到底是不是我寻找的那个目的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1213
translate chinese ch1ep2_2718f0e7:

    # m "Even if it's just a coincidence, I don't care."
    m "就算只是个巧合，我也不在乎。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1214
translate chinese ch1ep2_04458545:

    # m "But the fact that you always come whenever I wish for it is enough for me to hope it is you."
    m "但是光凭只要我心里想了，你就会出现这一点，就已经足够让我希望真的是你了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1215
translate chinese ch1ep2_c5b99e87:

    # m "Maybe Six and Eight gave their lives for this. For me to meet you and fill what I'm missing."
    m "说不定六号和八号就是为此献出了生命。为了让我遇到你，弥补我的空白。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1218
translate chinese ch1ep2_496d239f:

    # mc "A life..."
    mc "也就是，新的生活……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1219
translate chinese ch1ep2_1d6820cf:

    # m "Mhm. That's all I want as I carry their dreams and the name Six gave me."
    m "嗯。我身上承载着她们的梦想，以及六号给我的名字，我想要的仅此而已。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1220
translate chinese ch1ep2_41f63948:

    # m "I am not Lee Ha-Jeong."
    m "我不是李赫贞。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1221
translate chinese ch1ep2_b445fbb4:

    # m "I am not Subject Number Four either."
    m "我也不是四号实验体。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1222
translate chinese ch1ep2_7544ba8d:

    # m "Now that I have you, I can finally start accepting myself as Moon Chi!"
    m "有了你之后，我终于可以开始接受我作为气月的人生了！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1223
translate chinese ch1ep2_85899f66:

    # yt "This might just be the first {i}real{/i} smile I got from her so far."
    yt "这可能是我第一次看到她{i}真正的{/i}笑容。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1226
translate chinese ch1ep2_d0262064:

    # mc "You know, I don't care what your real name is. It doesn't matter to me whether it's Lee Ha-Jeong or Moon Chi."
    mc "知道吗，我不在乎你的真名是什么。不管是李赫贞也好，气月也好，对我来说都无所谓。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1227
translate chinese ch1ep2_5ce17b7b:

    # mc "Aside from your name and physical body, you are still {i}you{/i}, and that's all that matters."
    mc "除开你的名字和肉体，你依然还是{i}你{/i}，这才是重点。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1228
translate chinese ch1ep2_de0b878b:

    # mc "Now, whether or not I am the purpose you're looking for..."
    mc "不管我是不是你要找的那个目的……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1229
translate chinese ch1ep2_54fafc9c:

    # mc "I'll say, fuck that! It doesn't matter."
    mc "我都想告诉你，管他呢！这不重要。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1232
translate chinese ch1ep2_112b667a:

    # m "Huh?"
    m "啊？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1233
translate chinese ch1ep2_520d3c13:

    # mc "Because I will welcome you with arms open wide either way. Not because you need it, but because I want to."
    mc "因为无论如何，我都会张开双臂迎接你。不是因为你需要我那样，而是因为我想那样。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1234
translate chinese ch1ep2_2a36d8cd:

    # mc "Life is always full of uncertainties. So, how about we find out whether I am that person or not?"
    mc "生活总是充满了各种不确定性。所以，不如我们两个一起确定我到底是不是那个人？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1237
translate chinese ch1ep2_e612037c_6:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1240
translate chinese ch1ep2_43ab7746:

    # m "Yeah, I'd love that!"
    m "好啊，我很乐意！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1243
translate chinese ch1ep2_df4d08b5:

    # m "{i}{cps=20}Six...{w} Eight..."
    m "{i}{cps=20}六号……{w}八号……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1244
translate chinese ch1ep2_163e8b44:

    # m "{i}Is this it...?"
    m "{i}就是他吗……？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1245
translate chinese ch1ep2_ca42fb89:

    # m "{i}I found it, right...?"
    m "{i}我找到了，对吧……？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1251
translate chinese ch1ep2_29a4f6ab:

    # m "!!!"
    m "！！！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1254
translate chinese ch1ep2_3b3a387f_1:

    # m "*hics*"
    m "*抽泣*"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1262
translate chinese ch1ep2_f7db28bb:

    # mc "Hey, hey, hey! You said it hurts, didn't you? Did I say anything to make you cry?"
    mc "哎哎哎！你不是说了会很疼吗？我说了什么能让你哭出来的话吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1265
translate chinese ch1ep2_348b79ca:

    # m "I just felt..."
    m "我只是感觉……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1266
translate chinese ch1ep2_e612037c_7:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1269
translate chinese ch1ep2_e26d8525:

    # m "No, never mind."
    m "没事。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1277
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_850bd51a:

    # mc "Well, will this cheer you up?"
    mc "好吧，这个能让你开心点吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1278
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_f229f79f:

    # m "Mint?"
    m "薄荷味的？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1279
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_b0b96941:

    # mc "Mint."
    mc "薄荷味的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1282
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_bb725da7:

    # m "Mind sharing?"
    m "给我尝尝？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1285
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_d94b3345:

    # mc "Come and take it."
    mc "自己来拿。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1292
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_1418a8a4:

    # m "Mm, this tastes better than last time."
    m "嗯，比上次好吃。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1293
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_09a3fbaf:

    # m "Is it a different brand?"
    m "是换了个牌子吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1294
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_ef7e866b:

    # m "... Or is it because it just came out of your mouth?"
    m "……还是说是因为是从你嘴里拿出来的？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1295
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_07e7f909:

    # mc "Probably because I want you to take it from me this time."
    mc "可能是因为这次我想让你拿走。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1298
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_36e89c0e:

    # mc "Or perhaps you want something and are not afraid to get it?"
    mc "或者说，你可能也想要什么东西，并且还不怕得到它？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1299
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_7f3363a9:

    # mc "I'm still not quite used to this {i}Commander{/i} and {i}subordinate{/i} play, but I'll play along if we approach it our own way."
    mc "我依然不太习惯这什么“长官”和“下属”的角色扮演，但要是按我们自己的方法来的话，我也不介意配合你。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1300
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_67855c55:

    # m "*chuckles* God, I like you a lot. You're good at causing some {i}activity{/i} inside me."
    m "*轻笑* 天啊，我太喜欢你了。你很会让我{i}心潮澎湃{/i}。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1301
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_beb75935:

    # mc "Mind telling me what that activity is, hm? My dear subordinate..."
    mc "能跟我说说具体是哪里在澎湃吗，嗯？我亲爱的下属……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1302
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_e612037c:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1305
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_a42989d1:

    # m "Wanna cross the line with me?"
    m "想和我一起越线吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1306
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_cfaae932:

    # mc "Do you?"
    mc "你想吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1307
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_56800ba4:

    # m "Order me, Commander..."
    m "命令我就好，指挥官……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1308
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_803ee90e:

    # mc "You ever kissed a man before?"
    mc "你以前亲过别人吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1309
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_393a0e93:

    # m "No?"
    m "没有？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1310
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_0759be44:

    # mc "Then close your eyes."
    mc "那把眼睛闭上。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1313
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_e612037c_1:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1316
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_ca1c1302:

    # m "Stop, not here."
    m "停一下，这里不行。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1323
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_152ea279:

    # m "Coast is clear."
    m "这里没有危险。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1329
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_2472ea8d:

    # mc "Hold on, are you su-"
    mc "等等，你确定——"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1335
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_0ed8978d:

    # m "Yes, I am sure... Make me all dirty, Commander..."
    m "是的，我很确定……把我弄得乱七八糟吧，指挥官……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1336
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_64096996:

    # mc "In that case, are you prepared for your first order, Moon Chi?"
    mc "这样的话，准备好接受第一个命令了吗，气月？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1339
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_3c9cbd85:

    # m "Your wish..."
    m "一切……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1343
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_c7d2c1a4:

    # m "... Is my command."
    m "……都听你号令。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1347
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_943e7f53:

    # mc "Ah, ah, ah. While I appreciate your ambition, obedient subordinates never move without direct orders."
    mc "这样可不行。尽管我很欣赏你的用心，但服从命令的下属可从来不会在没有接到命令的时候擅自行动。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1348
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_eebb251c:

    # mc "Next time you make a mistake, there will be {i}consequences{/i}."
    mc "下次你要是再犯错，那就会有{i}后果{/i}了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1349
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_fefb1c80:

    # m "Mmm... and what do these {i}consequences{/i} look like?"
    m "嗯……什么样的{i}后果{/i}呢？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1350
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_cff787c6:

    # mc "Would you like a taste?"
    mc "想见识一下吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1351
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_90a8bb59:

    # m "I think I would..."
    m "还挺想的……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1354
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_a257275d:

    # mc "Just to see why you should obey, right?"
    mc "只是为了看看你为什么应该服从命令，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1355
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_1196e4a0:

    # m "Of course..."
    m "当然……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1358
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_4df78dbf:

    # "As soon as the words leave her mouth, you immediately close the distance, silencing her with your lips."
    "她的话音刚落，你就立刻拉近距离，用你的嘴唇让她沉默。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1359
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_a48c3553:

    # "Surprised at first, she quickly regains her composure, deepening the kiss."
    "她一开始有些惊讶，却很快恢复了镇定，更加用力地吻了上来。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1360
translate chinese moonlollipopplay_29e22e80:

