    # pk "We need to know your side of the story. We believe everyone should feel safe and comfortable at school, and that includes you."
    pk "我们想知道你的视角的描述。我们认为每个学生在学校里都应该感到安全、舒适，也包括你。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3423
translate chinese naomipause3_82091822_6:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3426
translate chinese naomipause3_75119282:

    # k "They... One was saying mean things to me, and one was trying to stab me with a knife. It pissed me off, so I tried to stop them."
    k "她们……一个对我说了很过分的话，另一个想拿刀捅我。我很生气，就想让她们停下。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3427
translate chinese naomipause3_d4300402:

    # mp "My god..."
    mp "我的天……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3430
translate chinese naomipause3_d946bcd5:

    # pk "Thank you for sharing that with us, Klara. I know it takes courage for you to speak up."
    pk "谢谢你告诉我们，克拉拉。我知道，你肯定要鼓起很大勇气才能做到。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3431
translate chinese naomipause3_3ff7387f:

    # pk "We'll address the situation and make sure those girls understand the consequences of their actions."
    pk "我们一定会重视这个情况，让那两个女生知道她们的行为的后果。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3432
translate chinese naomipause3_d4436c62:

    # mp "Aside from that, we also want to help you develop healthy ways to cope with your emotions and communicate with others."
    mp "除此之外，我们也想帮助你学会处理情绪、与他人交流的健康方式。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3433
translate chinese naomipause3_69428eef:

    # mp "I'd like to invite you to join a support group here at school for students who struggle with social interaction."
    mp "我想邀请你加入学校里的一个互助小组，组里的学生都是在社交方面遇到了困难的同学。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3434
translate chinese naomipause3_6f72c06a:

    # mp "It's a safe space for everyone to share their experiences, learn from one another, and make friends."
    mp "是个能让所有人分享经验，互相学习，结交朋友的地方。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3435
translate chinese naomipause3_76b2c326:

    # k "... Friends? What does that mean?"
    k "……朋友？什么意思？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3436
translate chinese naomipause3_b7ed30b4:

    # mp "They are the people who will stay with you. The ones who will love you despite who you are."
    mp "朋友就是会陪着你的人。会不管你是什么样子，都爱你的人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3437
translate chinese naomipause3_010239cb:

    # k "... I don't want that. I don't need them."
    k "……我不想要朋友。不需要。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3440
translate chinese naomipause3_895b208d:

    # pk "We understand that it might feel overwhelming, but remember that we're here to support you every step of the way."
    pk "我们理解，你一时之间可能难以接受，但请记住，我们会帮你踏出每一步的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3441
translate chinese naomipause3_a0a8176f:

    # pk "You can start by attending just one session and see how you feel afterward."
    pk "你可以先只去一次，看看感觉如何。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3442
translate chinese naomipause3_03d8f6f3:

    # mp "And I'll be there with you, Klara. You can even tell me if you don't feel like continuing, and I'll stop the session."
    mp "我也会陪你一起去的，克拉拉。如果你不想继续的话，可以直接告诉我，以后就不必参加了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3443
translate chinese naomipause3_478a83d8:

    # mp "What do you think?"
    mp "你觉得呢？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3444
translate chinese naomipause3_82091822_7:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3447
translate chinese naomipause3_ca431dd2:

    # k "... I'll try."
    k "……我试试吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3450
translate chinese naomipause3_9c42c81a:

    # pk "That's all we ask: just give it a try. We believe in you."
    pk "这就是我们唯一的要求了，只要试一下就好。我们相信你。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3451
translate chinese naomipause3_733c6f08:

    # pk "You have the intelligence to catch up with your lessons despite your numerous absences."
    pk "尽管你经常缺席，但依然有足够的能力跟上教学进度。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3452
translate chinese naomipause3_359f1585:

    # pk "Your advisor also informed me that you have an incredible talent in sketch art."
    pk "你的班主任还告诉我，你在素描方面有非常出众的天赋。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3453
translate chinese naomipause3_222a9906:

    # pk "All that said, we're confident that you can make positive changes in your life with time and support."
    pk "综上所述，我们相信，只要有足够的时间、帮助，你一定可以做出积极的改变。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3456
translate chinese naomipause3_65f7ec9e:

    # mc "Did you attend?"
    mc "那你去参加互助小组了吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3457
translate chinese naomipause3_d5bd1c62:

    # k "Not only did I attend, but I found it entertaining, so I stayed."
    k "我不仅参加了，还觉得很有意思，所以就留下了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3458
translate chinese naomipause3_f446f30a:

    # k "Eventually, I opened up, and people started to understand me."
    k "后来，我慢慢开放起来，其他人也开始理解我了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3459
translate chinese naomipause3_b43b8bd6:

    # k "There were still those who clearly didn't like me, but it didn't matter at that point. I knew I wasn't alone."
    k "依然还有明显不喜欢我的人，但已经无所谓了。我知道，我不是一个人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3460
translate chinese naomipause3_ef0635ed:

    # k "I'm not trying to be ironic here, but it felt like a curse had been lifted from me."
    k "毫不讽刺地说，真的感觉像是我身上的诅咒被解除了一样。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3461
translate chinese naomipause3_f2311b71:

    # k "I was still me, but a better version. I got so used to talking with others that I almost forgot who I was before."
    k "我还是我，但是变得更好了。我变得太习惯于跟别人交流，以至于我都差点忘了我以前的样子。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3464
translate chinese naomipause3_3195cb67:

    # mc "Haha! Well, it's nice to know this version of you, [landlady]."
    mc "哈哈！我很高兴了解到另一个版本的你，[landlady!t]。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3465
translate chinese naomipause3_63e34e24:

    # mc "I knew you had a dark side within you, but I never knew your full origin story."
    mc "我知道你的心里有黑暗的一面，但是从来不知道原原本本的起源故事。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3474
translate chinese naomipause3_5a529497:

    # k "That's all there is to my past. It's nothing to write home about, really."
    k "我的过去就这么多了。没什么大不了的，真的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3475
translate chinese naomipause3_eedaa4e7:

    # mc "What do you mean, \"nothing to write home about\"?"
    mc "“没什么大不了的”是什么意思？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3476
translate chinese naomipause3_3573ace2:

    # mc "You went from that, to this. That makes you unique, [landlady], and I love every part of it."
    mc "你可是从那样，变成了这样。你很独特，[landlady!t]，我太喜欢了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3477
translate chinese naomipause3_3ded5fe3:

    # mc "Now, it might sound a bit cringe, but I'll say it anyway."
    mc "虽然这话听起来有点尬，但我还是要说。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3478
translate chinese naomipause3_66a423c9:

    # mc "Knowing this, I can proudly brag about you."
    mc "知道这些以后，我可以自豪地去炫耀你了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3479
translate chinese naomipause3_4568799e:

    # mc "\"Hey, this is my [landlady], and she's freaking cool!\", stuff like that."
    mc "“嘿，这是我[landlady!t]，她太酷了！”，这样的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3480
translate chinese naomipause3_bab898bf:

    # k "*giggles* It seems you know the exact words to get a woman my age all giddy and happy, [mc]."
    k "*笑* 你好像很懂什么话能让我这个年纪的女人开心起来，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3481
translate chinese naomipause3_b48d5d62:

    # mc "Come on, it wasn't that impressive!"
    mc "哪儿啊，哪儿有那么大效果！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3482
translate chinese naomipause3_45e36df3:

    # k "I've always known this about you: you have the innate ability to positively affect the people are you without realizing it."
    k "我一直都觉得你有这么一个特点：你有一种内在的能力，能在你不自觉的情况下，给你周围的人带来积极的影响。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3483
translate chinese naomipause3_ef8ff2c6:

    # k "And I told you, small things like a simple show of appreciation are enough to make me happy."
    k "而且我跟你说了，只需要一件小事就够让我开心了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3484
translate chinese naomipause3_63449898:

    # k "No need to go all fancy next time, okay?"
    k "下次没必要大张旗鼓的，好吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3485
translate chinese naomipause3_2143f208:

    # yt "So she's looking forward to a next time. That's good."
    yt "看来她已经在期待下一次了。很好。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3486
translate chinese naomipause3_b26f60ea:

    # yt "I wonder how I can pull off something that would impress an experienced lady like her without being too fancy.."
    yt "不知道要用什么简单的东西，才能打动她这样经验丰富的女人的心……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3487
translate chinese naomipause3_0e10e8e4:

    # yt "That'll be a unique challenge, but it does make things interesting."
    yt "这是个很独特的挑战，但确实很有意思。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3488
translate chinese naomipause3_2a33ba24:

    # yt "Maybe I should approach things the old-fashioned way."
    yt "或许我该用老办法做事了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3489
translate chinese naomipause3_eabfbc3f:

    # yt "My job is to support her and ease the weight on her shoulders, and that's exactly what I'm doing."
    yt "我的职责就是支持她，减轻她肩上的负担，而这正是我现在正在做的事。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3490
translate chinese naomipause3_63905570:

    # mc "*chuckles* Alright, noted."
    mc "*轻笑* 好吧，我记住了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3511
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_e4ad35de:

    # k "Weeeeeeeeeeeeee~! AHAHAHAHAAA~!"
    k "啊哈哈哈哈哈哈~！芜~~~~~！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3512
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_2a655ed3:

    # mc "You're almost there, you're almost there."
    mc "马上到了，马上到了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3516
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_ccd0a7f5:

    # k "*softly chuckles* Thank you, [mc]... I had fun..."
    k "*轻笑* 谢谢你，[mc!t]……我很开心……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3517
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d7399ae6:

    # mc "Indeed. You had fun drinking all that wine and scaring the shit out of me."
    mc "是啊。你喝了那么多酒，还把我吓得不轻，真是太开心了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3518
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_fce58d2a:

    # k "Haah! I got you, didn't I?"
    k "哈哈！被我吓到了吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3519
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_eff3f577:

    # mc "Alright, alright, you did."
    mc "是啊，是啊，是吓住了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3520
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4423f75b:

    # mc "Now, rest. We both still have work tomorrow."
    mc "好好休息吧，我们两个明天都要工作呢。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:3521
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_76a013ce:

    # k "Wait..."
    k "等一下……"

