    gl "哎，小两口！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4096
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_9740825e:

    # gl "Oh... did I interrupt something?"
    gl "哦……我打扰到你们了吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4097
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_f92cef85:

    # g "Yes, you did."
    g "是的，打扰到了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4100
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_ecfcb7c4:

    # mc "*shaking his head*"
    mc "*摇头*"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4103
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_c551a45c:

    # gl "Wait, kids, what did I do?!"
    gl "等等啊，孩子们，我又干嘛了？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4108
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_ff99576b:

    # gl "Come on, tell me. What did I do?"
    gl "拜托，告诉我啊。我干嘛了？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4109
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_1ea603c5:

    # g "Just get us there, dad."
    g "你送我们过去就是了，爸。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4111
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_2dfc58ef:

    # gl "But you're pissed!"
    gl "可是你生气了啊！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4113
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_7a686455:

    # mc "She does sound pissed."
    mc "她听起来是生气了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4115
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_41a42117:

    # g "Let me drive, then. Scoot over."
    g "那就让我开车。让开。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4116
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_f3ac0628:

    # gl "No can do. This is my ride. Why don't you ask Johnny to get yours?"
    gl "那不行。这是我的车。你怎么不让强尼把你的车开来？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4120
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_61d44be3:

    # g "Because why would you arrive when we were just getting to the juicy part?!"
    g "因为为什么你偏偏在我们干正事之前来啊？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4121
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_1c7fcfe6:

    # gl "Oh... my bad..."
    gl "噢……不好意思……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4124
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_963ac885:

    # gl "Anywho, are you ready?"
    gl "总之，你们准备好了吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4127
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_a6d8a2fa:

    # g "Well, whatever happens, I have you boys anyway. I've got nothing to lose."
    g "嗯，不管发生什么，反正我有你们两个陪着。又不会损失什么。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4128
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_70a483b1:

    # mc "Now {i}that's{/i} the Gwen I know."
    mc "这才是我认识的格温嘛。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4131
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_849e71ea:

    # gl "..."
    gl "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4134
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_1458cfa8:

    # gl "Don't squirt on my floor, both of you. Just had the car washed."
    gl "你们两个，别把水弄到我的车上。我刚洗过车。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4137
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_e7706959:

    # g "Ahahahahaaa!"
    g "啊哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4138
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_b2b9e19d:

    # mc "What do you mean?"
    mc "你什么意思？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4151
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_45ee6740:

    # mc "Is this the place?"
    mc "是这里吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4152
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_f1578162:

    # g "Yep!"
    g "对！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4153
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_99656307:

    # gl "Did Gwen mention this area to you?"
    gl "格温跟你说过这个地方吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4154
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_effa0d1c:

    # mc "Yeah, she said we can't go through here when it gets dark."
    mc "是啊，她说天一黑就不能从这里过了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4159
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_7cc5153b:

    # gl "It's not that we can't, but more like we shouldn't. People try to avoid this place at night."
    gl "不是说不能；而是说不应该。人们到了晚上一般都会避开这里的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4160
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_82923620:

    # mc "May I ask why? What kind of danger happens here?"
    mc "能问问为什么吗？这里有什么危险？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4165
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_b6bdb32f:

    # gl "Kidnappers, carjackers, holdups, and even occasional rape cases."
    gl "绑架，劫车，抢劫，有时候还会有强奸。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4166
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_975b4565:

    # gl "Seems like a lush and peaceful place at first sight, right?"
    gl "第一眼看上去是个草木茂盛，很平静的地方，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4167
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_c5b1d431:

    # mc "Yeah... I feel like I could picnic here and would have no problems at all."
    mc "是啊……我感觉都可以在这里野餐，什么问题都不会出。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4168
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_0b0a680b:

    # gl "Exactly, and that's the deceiving part."
    gl "没错，这就是最有欺骗性的地方。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4169
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_528ad3b1:

    # gl "We could take the main road all the way to the freeway, but that would take us five hours to get to Emilda's place."
    gl "我们可以沿着大路一路走上高速，不过那样就得花五个小时才能到埃米尔达家了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4170
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_f9e99bb3:

    # gl "And we don't want that as Emilda hates nighttime visitors."
    gl "那样不行，因为埃米尔达讨厌晚上来客人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4171
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_ea464ef4:

    # mc "Even family?"
    mc "连家人也不行？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4172
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d9d40c31:

    # g "Yeah, it doesn't matter."
    g "是啊，她一视同仁。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4173
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_da9e16d5:

    # g "She's a woman who has strict rules, and you need to follow them no matter who you are."
    g "她是个有很严厉的原则的女人，不管是谁都要遵守。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4174
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_3afc343d:

    # g "As dad and I are both extremely laid-back people, we are among her most despised enemies."
    g "因为我和我爸都是特别随性的人，所以我们俩是她最讨厌的敌人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4175
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_55f21d26:

    # g "Especially me, given who I am now."
    g "特别是我，毕竟我现在这幅样子。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4180
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_294b6ca6:

    # mc "That clears some things up for me but raises more questions. How did you two even end up together?"
    mc "这让我明白了一点，但又有了更多的问题。既然如此，你们俩到底是怎么结婚的？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4181
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_be50bedd:

    # gl "Shit happens ahahaha!"
    gl "一切皆有可能嘛。哈哈哈哈哈！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4182
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_3ddb644e:

    # gl "Well, I can't remember the last time we saw each other. Maybe she doesn't even remember me."
    gl "我都记不得我们两个上次见面是什么时候了。可能她都已经不记得我了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4185
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_ea44692b:

    # g "Oh, I don't think she'd forget so easily..."
    g "噢，我觉得她可不会这么轻易地忘掉……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4186
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_197ab16c:

    # gl "Is there... something I should know?"
    gl "有什么……我应该知道的事情吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4187
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_c37317ea:

    # g "Wait, I know something about mom that you don't?"
    g "等等，关于我妈，我知道你不知道的事？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4188
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_bb54099c:

    # gl "I'd be happy to hear what it is, Gwen. Unexpected things like that make me nervous when it comes to your mom."
    gl "我很想听听是什么事，格温。一有关你妈，这种意料之外的事就会让我紧张。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4189
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_c0dde58c:

    # g "You'll see, or maybe you won't. She never told anyone about it anyway."
    g "你到时候就知道了，也可能不会知道。反正她从来没告诉过任何人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4190
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_0c90d24d:

    # g "I only discovered it by accident, and I don't think she'll like it if I tell you."
    g "我也是意外才发现的，而且我觉得要是告诉你了，她肯定不乐意。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4191
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_b27c8352:

    # gl "Not even one hint?"
    gl "连个提示都不给？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4192
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_c32b5a93:

    # g "You're her husband. Why don't you ask her when we get there?"
    g "你是她丈夫啊。你怎么不等到了之后自己问问？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4195
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_c596edd1:

    # gl "Ex. Ex-husband."
    gl "前夫。前夫！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4196
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_8fa9cf62:

    # gl "I'd be surprised if she even looks twice in my direction."
    gl "要是她多看我一眼我都要去买彩票了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4197
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_b6426cff:

    # g "*chuckles* I figured you'd say that."
    g "*轻笑* 就知道你会这么说。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4210
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d4eca6ab:

    # mc "Whoa, whoa, whoa..."
    mc "哇哇哇……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4211
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_aedd888a:

    # mc "You're doing your assignments now? Is it because the final exam is coming, or did you get a concussion that changed your personality?"
    mc "你居然开始做作业了？是因为期末考试快到了，还是说你撞到了头，变了个人？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4212
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_9203b8fe:

    # mc "Are you sick? What did you eat?"
    mc "你病了吗？吃错什么东西了？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4213
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_e57485c2:

    # g "No, I'm writing a song."
    g "没有，我在写歌。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4216
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_b5b308b9:

    # mc "A... song? The heck?"
    mc "写……歌？真的？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4219
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_5bad6137:

    # gl "Did he finally hear it?"
    gl "他终于听到了？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4220
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4b340443_1:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4223
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_51e71a71:

    # g "It took me some time to sing again, but I did. He did hear me sing it, much to my surprise."
    g "我花了很久才能重新唱歌，但我的确唱了。我没想到他会听到。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4224
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_848d18bf:

    # gl "What did he say?"
    gl "他怎么说？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4228
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_85e4472c:

    # g "He was speechless, at the time... just enjoyed every part of it..."
    g "他当时，一句话也没有说……只是从头到尾在默默欣赏……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4231
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4839a089:

    # gl "I'd expect nothing less from him."
    gl "跟我想的一模一样。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4232
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d6429df1:

    # gl "[mc] is a rare man, Gwen. Not everyone can muster the courage to do something like this."
    gl "[mc!t]是个很少见的男人，格温。不是每个人都能有勇气做这种事。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4233
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_407f267d:

    # gl "Even I must admit: if I were in his place, I wouldn't have had the mental and emotional strength to even think about Emilda, let alone suggest to talk with her."
    gl "哪怕是我也必须承认：如果换成我来的话，我连想埃米尔达都不敢想，更别说提议跟她谈谈了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4236
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_afe76fab:

    # g "I know..."
    g "我知道……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4237
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_0ce0d9b6:

    # g "I may not have been the first to know him considering his past interactions with Aine and Emma..."
    g "他过去和艾妮和艾玛有过渊源，所以我算不上第一个认识他的人……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4238
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_be675f01:

    # g "But I know that I'm the only one who knows who he truly is in his heart of hearts."
    g "但我知道，我是唯一一个知道他内心深处到底是什么样子的人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4241
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d0ed2247:

    # g "I love him, dad. I love him so much."
    g "我爱他，爸爸。我太爱他了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4242
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_22d8e569:

    # gl "That's why you left."
    gl "所以你才离开。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4243
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_963da150:

    # g "It may have been stupid of me, but I will never regret that decision..."
    g "我那么做可能很傻，但是我永远不会后悔那个决定……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4244
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_41c08652:

    # g "It was worth it... so that I could meet him again..."
    g "为了能够再见到他……太值得了……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4245
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_64d02d6b:

    # g "Although, I don't have to tell him right now."
    g "尽管，我现在没必要告诉他。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4246
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_95403ee8:

    # g "I'm afraid, dad..."
    g "我害怕，爸爸……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4247
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_55e2cce4:

    # gl "Of what?"
    gl "怕什么？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4248
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d95a3474:

    # g "I'm afraid I might get my heart torn apart again." with Dissolve(1.0)
    g "害怕我的心会再碎掉。" with Dissolve(1.0)

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4251
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_849e71ea_1:

    # gl "..."
    gl "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4254
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_5fafc0c3:

    # gl "My daughter, who I know better than anybody..."
    gl "我的女儿，我最了解的人……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4255
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_9ac595f8:

    # gl "The one who's always unapologetically bold and level-headed... I've never seen you act this way."
    gl "那个一直都毫不掩饰，又勇敢，又冷静的人……我从来没有见过你这个样子。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4258
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_272e963e:

    # g "*chuckles* He's the only one who ever did, and he's the only one who ever could."
    g "*笑* 只有他让我这样过，也只有他能让我这样。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4259
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_7a4b0d58:

    # g "It may have started with lust, but I fell for him hard, dad..."
    g "事情开始的契机可能是肉欲，但是我爱上他了，爸爸……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4260
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_9766aeb8:

    # g "Harder than I ever expected myself to."
    g "爱得比我预想得还深。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4263
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d3c2b55c:

    # g "I mean, look at him."
    g "你看看他。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4264
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_03b0a484:

    # g "He's clearly tired from all the weight on his shoulders, and yet... he's still trying to be the bridge for our family."
    g "他肩上的担子那么重，显然已经累得不行了，但是……还是想成为我们家和好的桥梁。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4265
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_0cec282b:

    # g "I don't care about what others think anymore. As long as I have him, I will never ask for more..."
    g "我已经不在乎其他人怎么想了。只要我还有他，就再也不会要求更多了……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4266
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_2bbee5e0:

    # gl "Ah, youth..."
    gl "啊，青春啊……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4270
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_b4fd40b7:

    # gl "Wake him up, though. We're here."
    gl "不过，该把他喊醒了。我们到了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4271
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_3beed9d4:

    # g "Wait, how long have we been here?"
    g "等等，我们到了多久了？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4272
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_3b94b7b5:

    # gl "About five minutes now."
    gl "差不多五分钟。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4273
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_686cc0c7:

    # g "Shit, shit, shit!"
    g "完蛋完蛋完蛋！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4276
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_fb649b51:

    # g "[mc]?"
    g "[mc!t]？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4277
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_3f871f46:

    # mc "Hmm?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4278
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_3d64da7e:

    # g "[mc], wake up! We're here!"
    g "[mc!t]，醒醒！我们到了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4281
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4744998e:

    # mc "Oh, damn. Sorry, I dozed off."
    mc "噢，好。抱歉，我睡着了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4282
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_0a492258:

    # mc "... But I could get used to waking up to sights like this one."
    mc "……不过我挺喜欢一睁眼就看到这种美景的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4283
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_83480c0b:

    # g "Don't tempt me, [mc]... we have to go meet the witch."
    g "别诱惑我，[mc!t]……我们还得去见老巫婆呢。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4284
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_81f6a343:

    # gl "And I'm sure you'll need that rest for what will happen next."
    gl "而且考虑到接下来要发生的事，你刚刚的休息肯定很有必要。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4290
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4d0f8492:

    # mc "This place is pretty... how should I say this..."
    mc "这地方很漂亮……我该怎么描述呢……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4293
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_63387bcc:

    # mc "Grandiose?"
    mc "很宏伟？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4294
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d2bf0f94:

    # g "It fits dad's tastes more, to be honest."
    g "说实话，这里更符合我爸的品味。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4295
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d2d4ad97:

    # gl "I built it myself after our marriage. I see she hasn't changed much."
    gl "这里是我们结婚之后我亲自建起来的。看来她没有改动太多。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4299
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_241c54fa:

    # un "I HATE HER!"
    un "{b}我讨厌她！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4302
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_62f34446:

    # gl "Yep, we're definitely at the right place..."
    gl "嗯，确实是来对地方了……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4305
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_eb3ddd60:

    # mc "Who was that?"
    mc "那是谁啊？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4306
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_ffc3cc04:

    # g "Knowing her? Probably one of her reading buddies."
    g "估计是她的书友。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4309
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_fa6fdcb3:

    # emi "Hey, you can't just turn your back on me like that, dear!"
    emi "喂，亲爱的，你怎么能就这么走掉！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4312
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_849e71ea_2:

    # gl "..."
    gl "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4316
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_583b5da1:

    # emi "Oh."
    emi "呦呵。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4318
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_16b47bf9:

    # gl "You see? One word from her becomes a knife in your heart, stopping you dead!"
    gl "看吧？她只要两个字就能变成一把尖刀插到你的心上，把你捅死！"

