    gl "你觉得我放哪了？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4330
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_e2e3f898:

    # emi "You left it somewhere else! Why do you think I couldn't find it?"
    emi "你放到别的地方去了！不然我为什么会找不到？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4331
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d7d96c81:

    # gl "I placed it exactly as instructed!"
    gl "我就是按你说的放的！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4332
