    # emi "You also...!"
    emi "你还……！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4336
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_f484c835:

    # gl "What?!"
    gl "什么？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4337
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_0a9306ca:

    # emi "You also insisted on..."
    emi "你还非得……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4338
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_12ec641c:

    # emi "... On buying that stupid book with the supposed secrets of architecture!"
    emi "……非得买那本说是有什么建筑业的秘密的破书！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4340
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4de871f3:

    # gl "I didn't insist! I asked if you wanted to buy it!"
    gl "我没有非得买！我问了你想不想买！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4341
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_cbeedd71:

    # emi "I wasn't interested!"
    emi "我根本不感兴趣！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4342
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_16c62aa4:

    # g "Mom?"
    g "妈？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4343
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_e25c0806:

    # gl "That's why I asked you!"
    gl "所以我才问你的！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4344
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4c1b2cba:

    # emi "I said no, yet you still bought it!"
    emi "我说不买，但是你还是买了！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4345
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_9b21e61d:

    # g "Dad?"
    g "爸？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4346
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_7f775067:

    # gl "Because I wanted to read it!"
    gl "因为我想看啊！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4347
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_8081a2f6:

    # emi "Then why bother asking me?!"
    emi "那你还问我干嘛？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4350
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_47ae18bd:

    # g "MOM, DAD!!"
    g "{b}爸，妈！！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4353
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_cb45d44a:

    # gl "..." (multiple=2)
    gl "……" (multiple=2)

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4354
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_c423dd0a:

    # emi "..." (multiple=2)
    emi "……" (multiple=2)

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4355
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_b0dcbb6d:

    # g "Can we... not start with this?"
    g "我们能……别这样吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4356
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_f8e56639:

    # g "Please?"
    g "拜托了？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4359
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_7d91396e:

    # gl "Whatever, Emilda."
    gl "随便吧，埃米尔达。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4360
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_6f0ccb3d:

    # gl "Is my room clean?!"
    gl "我的房间干不干净？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4361
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_e8163dd3:

    # emi "Use your eyes, not your mouth!"
    emi "多用眼看，少用嘴说！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4364
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_3eb0bf33:

    # emi "..."
    emi "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4365
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_6e69e595:

    # emi "...."
    emi "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4367
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_ce07dac8:

    # emi "Ooohh..."
    emi "啊啊……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4371
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_21e673d7:

    # mc "Woah!"
    mc "哇！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4372
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4c5f21a7:

    # g "And... there you go..."
    g "正好赶上……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4373
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_95a13f52:

    # emi "W-water... Get me some water..."
    emi "水-水……给我点水……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4376
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_5e088fae:

    # mc "Gwen, help me drag her to the lounge."
    mc "格温，帮我把她抬到椅子上。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4377
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_eceefe15:

    # g "Sure..."
    g "好……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4389
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_9f126582:

    # yt "Now that I got a good look at them both, Gwen is certainly the spitting image of Emilda."
    yt "现在仔细看看她们两个，格温真是和埃米尔达一模一样。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4390
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_9cb2055d:

    # mc "Is it what I think it is?"
    mc "是我想的那样吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4391
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_3ab9fe49:

    # g "It's exactly what you think it is."
    g "就是你想的那样。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4392
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d6d89733:

    # mc "So Glenn doesn't know about this?"
    mc "格伦不知道吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4393
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_6987d975:

    # g "No. Her pride is more important to her, after all."
    g "不知道。毕竟她的尊严比她自己更重要。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4394
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_5c5c39e4:

    # g "Isn't that right, mom?"
    g "是这样吧，妈妈？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4397
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_32555a5b:

    # emi "You shouldn't have come here."
    emi "你不该来的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4398
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_02ba93ab:

    # g "I didn't want to."
    g "我也不想来。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4401
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_bfeb34dc:

    # g "You cast me away like a stray animal instead of your daughter. I don't have one damn reason to see you."
    g "你都没有把我当女儿，像赶流浪动物一样把我赶走了。我根本没有任何理由来见你。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4402
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4b900b1b:

    # g "But dad and [mc] here insisted that I should come, so we could have a chance to talk as a family."
    g "但是爸爸和[mc!t]坚持让我来，说是这样才有机会作为一家人说说话。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4403
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_1560249c:

    # g "And then the first thing you did was pick a fight?"
    g "我们来了之后你做的第一件事就是吵架？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4404
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_f25706b6:

    # g "How long has it been since dad and I left? I can't even remember anymore."
    g "我跟爸爸已经离开多久了？我甚至都记不清了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4405
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_0b0e923e:

    # g "Get a fucking grip and move on."
    g "少他妈多事，看开点吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4408
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_1f1b646d:

    # emi "I was hoping you'd be more mature and respectful the next time I saw you, but clearly, that was wishful thinking."
    emi "我本希望我再见到你的时候，你会变得更成熟，更尊重人，但显然，是我一厢情愿罢了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4409
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_51f82551:

    # emi "You run your mouth even more now."
    emi "你更加口无遮拦了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4412
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_69a37853:

    # emi "It is because of this insolent, uncultured... boy, I assume?"
    emi "我想……是因为这个粗野、没教养的男生吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4420
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_56c5afd2:

    # mc "Emilda, if I may-{w=0.5}{nw}"
    mc "埃米尔达，请听我——{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4424
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_860932fb:

    # emi "{b}You{/b} shut your mouth!"
    emi "{b}你{/b}给我把嘴闭上！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4425
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_2d24f170:

    # emi "You are the sole reason why this family was destroyed, and now you have the guts to show up here?!"
    emi "我们家被毁掉完全是因为你，你现在居然还敢出现在我面前？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4426
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_cf86e96e:

    # emi "Who do you think you are?!"
    emi "你以为你是谁啊？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4427
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_9d4272ec:

    # mc "Uhm... I thought if only we could talk somehow..."
    mc "呃……我只是觉得，要是我们能谈谈……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4430
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_2b0f734b:

    # g "No, fuck this, [mc]! This will never work!"
    g "别说了，去他妈的吧，[mc!t]！跟她这种人根本说不通！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4431
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_ae2df52e:

    # g "We're leaving. Now!"
    g "我们走。走！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4434
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_1d8297a8:

    # yt "Ugh, shit! I should have waited for a better chance to jump in."
    yt "啊，操！我应该等到合适的时候再开口的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4435
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_63ad46c7:

    # yt "Now I just made everything worse!"
    yt "我反而让情况更糟了！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4446
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_37b2c68b:

    # g "Call [mc] that again and I will fucking {b}kill{/b} you... Just try it, I hope the fuck you do..."
    g "你再敢那么说[mc!t]试试，看看我他妈会不会{b}杀{/b}了你……你试试啊，我太他妈希望你试试了……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4447
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d68ca493:

    # yt "I wanna marry her right now..."
    yt "我想现在就跟她结婚……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4448
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_77773b64:

    # g "Don't even think about telling us to leave, since dad still owns this house..."
    g "你也别想让我们走人，因为这个房子还在我爸名下……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4449
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_e8106ffc:

    # g "Be glad that he still has some compassion left for you because if anything, you're the one who should have left..."
    g "他对你还有点感情，你该高兴才对，因为该走的人是你……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4453
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_dfdc693f:

    # emi "Right, {i}I{/i} should have been the one who left after trying my best for what we once called {i}our family{/i}."
    emi "对，哪怕为了{i}我们家{/i}尽心尽力，该走的人也是{i}我{/i}。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4454
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_eb85628b:

    # emi "{i}I{/i} should have been the one who left for trying to make you a proper woman."
    emi "哪怕费尽心思想把你培养成得体的女人，该走的人也是{i}我{/i}。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4456
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_15319a5e:

    # g "*scoffs* Proper woman."
    g "*冷笑* 呵，得体的女人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4457
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_f5885ec3:

    # g "Shut up and maybe kill that attitude until at least tomorrow."
    g "闭嘴吧，再把你那个态度收一收，看看能不能至少忍到明天。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4458
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_f880e667:

    # g "Despite all your bullshit, we're sincerely trying to give you a proper birthday here."
    g "哪怕你尽在胡扯，我们也是真心想给你庆祝一下生日。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4461
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_529da807:

    # emi "!!!"
    emi "！！！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4464
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_88ccfd1c:

    # yt "That's a genuine reaction! Could it be that she didn't know it was her birthday tomorrow?!"
    yt "她刚刚的反应是发自真心的！难道她不知道明天是她的生日？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4467
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_00fb293e:

    # g "Let's get out of here, [mc]."
    g "我们走吧，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4468
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d5dbd20c:

    # yt "This feels like I'm choosing the right wires to cut in a ticking time bomb."
    yt "现在的感觉就像是我在拆解定时炸弹，要找一根正确的线剪断一样。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4469
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_7569a6a3:

    # yt "I should approach this delicate situation carefully."
    yt "我必须用非常谨慎的手段来解决眼下这么棘手的状况……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4470
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_8b711e4f:

    # yt "For now, let's observe and ask for clues on what I can do."
    yt "现在，就暂且先观察，看看我能做些什么吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4471
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_bb81cfef:

    # yt "I need to get a chance to talk to Emilda somehow, but now is not the right time. I'll let them cool off first."
    yt "我得找个办法和埃米尔达说上话，但现在不是时候。先让她们冷静一下吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4481
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_2452e03f:

    # g "Ugh... I'm exhausted."
    g "唉……我累死了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4485
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_744da43a:

    # mc "It took that much to face her, huh?"
    mc "跟她说话就那么费劲吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4489
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_837a9eca:

    # g "I doubt this will work, [mc]. You saw what always happens when we see each other."
    g "我觉得这样是没用的，[mc!t]。你也看到了，我们一见面就会这样。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4490
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4e55c160:

    # g "For a moment, everything starts with the expected big fight."
    g "一开始大吵一架，在我意料之中。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4491
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_eeb6d8ae:

    # g "But as the conversation continues, things return to how they used to be: just sparring with words."
    g "但是越继续说下去，情况就越和以前一样：只是用言语互相攻击罢了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4492
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_557d5e74:

    # g "Or at least that's how things have been after our family went into disarray."
    g "至少我们家散了之后就一直那样。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4493
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4496
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_c5260767:

    # mc "I'm wondering..."
    mc "我在想……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4499
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_b68b47dc:

    # mc "Does she have anything she likes?"
    mc "她有什么喜欢的东西吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4500
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_759f8c91:

    # g "Like material things, or...?"
    g "你是指实际的物品，还是……？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4501
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_e59abd2a:

    # mc "Anything."
    mc "什么都行。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4504
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_421e8bf6:

    # g "Hm, well... I can name a few."
    g "嗯，这个……我可以告诉你几个。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4511
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_7be10ae6:

    # "7 pm..."
    "晚上7点……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4519
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_78b021ab:

    # yt "It's seven, and yet no one's in the kitchen or even downstairs."
    yt "七点了，但是厨房里一个人都没有，甚至都没人下楼。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4520
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_487b266c:

    # yt "This family is in complete shambles."
    yt "这家人完全乱成一团了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4523
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4f39d24a:

    # yt "Still, I'll proceed as planned and wait till she gets here."
    yt "不过，我还是要按计划行事，等她过来。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4527
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_98096cd8:

    # g "She used to be the main cook for the family, but she liked it when dad served her food, especially when it was specifically cooked for her."
    g "以前家里都是她做饭，不过她也很喜欢我爸做饭，特别是专门给她一个人做的时候。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4528
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_22824ec0:

    # mc "Uh-huh..."
    mc "嗯哼……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4529
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_57db4955:

    # g "Be careful, though. She has quite a taste for gourmet food."
    g "不过你得小心。她对美食非常挑剔。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4530
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d6334050:

    # g "She used to critique dad's food all the time, and that's how he eventually got good at cooking."
    g "她以前经常评价我爸做的菜，他也是因为这个，厨艺慢慢变好了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4533
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_7ae6992b:

    # g "Just take note..."
    g "记住了……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4534
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_777a6864:

    # g "Whatever you're gonna do, be yourself, and don't let her intimidate you."
    g "不管你准备怎么做，都要做自己，不要被她吓到。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4535
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_3f29532c:

    # g "She can sense fear and uses that to her advantage, be it a normal conversation or argument."
    g "不管是闲聊也好，还是争吵也好，她都能感受到你的恐惧，再把你的恐惧转化成她的优势。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4536
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_e0b9e54d:

    # g "That said, you're neither my dad nor me, so still show her respect as much as you can."
    g "话虽如此，你也不是我或者我爸，所以还是要尽量尊重她的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4537
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_38cff258:

    # g "Lastly, don't mention our relationship: she'll hate that."
    g "最后，不要提咱俩的关系，她肯定不想听。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4538
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4af0b1a7:

    # g "If she wants to talk about it, let her initiate the conversation."
    g "如果她想谈那个话题，就让她先开头。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4542
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_e1871956:

    # yt "I may flip burgers daily, but I know my fine dining."
    yt "我虽然每天做的都只是汉堡而已，但下厨其实也是不在话下的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4549
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d3c21ec2:

    # yt "So get your ass down here, Emilda!"
    yt "所以你赶紧给我过来吧，埃米尔达！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4554
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_162a8ca0:

    # emi "*sniffs*"
    emi "*闻*"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4557
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4262c4d1:

    # emi "Who's..."
    emi "是谁……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4558
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_af0ae69b:

    # emi "Oh my god, is that Glenn?"
    emi "我的天啊，是格伦吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4561
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_597969e7:

    # emi "Hmm..."
    emi "嗯……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4563
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_583b5da1_1:

    # emi "Oh."
    emi "呦呵。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4566
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_17f8c54b:

    # yt "That \"Oh\" does hurt. I feel you now, Glenn. I feel you."
    yt "这句“呦呵”确实很伤人。我懂你的感觉，格伦。我懂你。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4569
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4bcad4d6:

    # yt "But the smell brought her down here. That's a good start."
    yt "不过气味把她引来了。这是个很好的开始。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4570
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_b2670f66:

    # yt "Now, to finish plating this."
    yt "现在只需要装盘就行了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4573
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_153b45b9:

    # emi "So it's just Gwen's boyfriend."
    emi "原来是格温的男朋友啊。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4580
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_e01a0d8b:

    # mc "Good evening, Emilda."
    mc "晚上好，埃米尔达。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4581
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_21811382:

    # mc "Are we perhaps expecting anyone to be down here at this time?"
    mc "你们家一般是在这个时候吃饭吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4582
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_3eb0bf33_1:

    # emi "..."
    emi "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4583
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_f782104c:

    # emi "No. And that's \"ma'am\" to you."
    emi "不是。还有，要叫我“女士”。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4584
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_037f7e91:

    # emi "I don't recall giving you permission to use my kitchen, young man."
    emi "我不记得允许你用我的厨房了，年轻人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4589
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_a63e80a4:

    # mc "*chuckles* Gwen and I aren't a couple yet, Emilda. But we are getting there."
    mc "*轻笑* 我和格温还不是情侣呢，埃米尔达。不过我们也快成了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4590
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_064d7455:

    # emi "Hmp, that's \"ma'am\" to you, fornicator."
    emi "哼，要叫我“女士”才对。我不记得我允许过你和我的女儿行男女之事。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4591
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_a43a25f0:

    # emi "And I don't recall giving you permission to use my kitchen."
    emi "我也不记得我允许过你用我的厨房。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4595
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_68f6f6f3:

    # emi "I can't believe you would just go ahead and use my belongings without asking. We're nowhere near close, and your parents should have taught you better."
    emi "真不敢相信，你居然问都不问，就擅自用我的东西。我们根本就不熟，你的父母真该好好教育一下你。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4596
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_314879ef:

    # emi "If not for Gwen, you would have been long gone by now."
    emi "要不是因为格温，你早就被赶走了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4597
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_3854d3d5:

    # yt "I know Gwen told me she'd kill me, but I don't think she's that intimidating."
    yt "格温是说了她能杀了我，但是我觉得她也没那么吓人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4598
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_f5faef3b:

    # yt "Perhaps she's holding back because of what Gwen told her earlier? Or is it something else?"
    yt "说不定她是因为格温之前的话，刻意忍着没有发作？还是说有别的原因？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4599
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_e4982bd5:

    # yt "Now that is interesting."
    yt "这下有意思了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4600
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_5e1bb388:

    # yt "Sorry, Gwen. But if I have to be myself, I'll do this my way."
    yt "抱歉，格温。不过如果让我做自己的话，我就一定得这样了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4603
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_f2d9c517:

    # mc "You're right, ma'am. I shouldn't be here, so I have a proposal."
    mc "你说得没错，女士。我不该在这的，所以我想提出一个提议。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4606
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_09464a4e:

    # emi "Whatever; I'm not interested in talking to you."
    emi "随便吧；我没兴趣和你说话。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4607
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_0fc2307a:

    # emi "You are the one who-{w=0.5}{nw}"
    emi "都是因为你——{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4610
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_88e906b0:

    # mc "Are you sure about that?"
    mc "你确定吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4613
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4ce5a71a:

    # emi "*gulps*"
    emi "*咽口水*"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4614
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_2dcb57ee:

    # yt "Come on, sit down. You can't resist the delectable, mouthwatering aroma, can you?"
    yt "快点，快坐下啊。你肯定抗拒不了这令人垂涎欲滴的香气吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4617
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_e832fe99:

    # gl "*whispers* Shit, that smells so damn good! Did you know he can cook like that?"
    gl "*低语* 闻着可太香了！你知道他的手艺这么好吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4618
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_2c5e3665:

    # gl "*whispers* Even the plating looks elegant and inviting!"
    gl "*低语* 连装盘都很优雅，很诱人！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4621
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_a5696995:

    # g "*whispers* I knew he could cook, and he does taste good, but not like that!"
    g "*低语* 我知道他会做饭，他的味道也很好，但也不是这种好！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4622
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_0b589ada:

    # gl "*whispers* \"He tastes good\"...?"
    gl "*低语* “他的味道很好”……？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4625
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_3742ed46:

    # g "*whispers* Fuck~! I'm getting wet!"
    g "*低语* 操~！我都湿了！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4626
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_7276da9e:

    # gl "*whispers* Oh, stop..."
    gl "*低语* 你省省吧……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4629
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_ce86952c:

    # emi "... What is it that you propose?"
    emi "……你这是什么意思？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4630
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_e10938c0:

    # mc "It's simple."
    mc "很简单。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4631
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_ef3cd731:

    # mc "I know you despise me as I'm the one who destroyed your family."
    mc "我知道你讨厌我，因为是我毁了你家。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4632
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_9c478eb5:

    # mc "So if you don't like my food, I'll stay away from you and your family for good: even Gwen."
    mc "所以，如果你不喜欢我做的菜，我就永远离开你和你的家人，包括格温。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4633
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_cacdf3d2:

    # g "*whispers* He's confident."
    g "*低语* 他很自信。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4634
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4aa45fc5:

    # gl "*whispers* Recklessly so."
    gl "*低语* 感觉自信过头了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4636
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_25358eed:

    # emi "Hmp. And if I do?"
    emi "哼。那要是我喜欢呢？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4637
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_7fd630e3:

    # mc "First, we'll talk."
    mc "首先，我们聊聊。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4638
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_0fbf978a:

    # mc "And second, you'll let me call you by your name."
    mc "其次，你要允许我直呼你的名字。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4639
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_7739438e:

    # emi "You're underestimating me, are you not?"
    emi "你是在小看我吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4640
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_180d2278:

    # mc "*chuckles* I'm not the type to underestimate anybody, ma'am."
    mc "*轻笑* 我不会小看任何人，女士。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4643
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_3eb0bf33_2:

    # emi "..."
    emi "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4646
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_788b5456:

    # emi "Alright, you've got yourself a deal, young man."
    emi "好吧，我同意你的提议，年轻人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4654
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_08b4d42d:

    # mc "I hope you enjoy our offering tonight."
    mc "希望你喜欢今晚供应的菜肴。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4659
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d79ce8d3:

    # mc "Excellent!"
    mc "很好！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4660
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_566781f1:

    # mc "Welcome to [mc]'s popup restaurant, exclusively open for our one and lovely guest."
    mc "欢迎来到[mc!t]的快闪餐厅，专为我们仅此一位，可爱迷人的贵客开门营业。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4661
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_349bbb79:

    # mc "We have a charming table ready for you, Madam."
    mc "我们已为您精心备好了餐桌，女士。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4662
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_133e7400:

    # mc "Please, allow me to guide you to your seat."
    mc "请允许我指引您到您的座位上。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4666
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_3eb0bf33_3:

    # emi "..."
    emi "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4667
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_5ee0bb49:

    # emi "At least you know how to act like a gentleman. I'll assume this is how you enchanted my daughter."
    emi "至少你知道绅士是什么样子的。我想你就是这么勾引到我的女儿的吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4670
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_51020f4a:

    # gl "*whispers* He's killing it!"
    gl "*低语* 他表现得太完美了！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4671
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_dbfb8d5b:

    # g "*whispers* Absolutely. But did mom just call me her daughter?"
    g "*低语* 那当然。不过妈妈刚才是不是说我是她的女儿了？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4675
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_08b4d42d_1:

    # mc "I hope you enjoy our offering tonight."
    mc "希望您喜欢今晚供应的菜肴。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4677
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_ab605e29:

    # emi "... What do we have here?"
    emi "……都有什么菜？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4678
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_fc466bd4:

    # yt "Alright, let's go Naomi mode."
    yt "好了，进入娜奥米模式。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4681
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_c21ef4e3:

    # mc "I'm delighted to present our signature dish:{w} the Confit Potato and Gourmet Burger Patty with our exquisite yellow sauce."
    mc "我很高兴向您介绍我们的招牌菜：鸭油炖马铃薯和精制汉堡肉饼，配以我们精心调制的黄色酱汁。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4682
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_52e1e732:

    # mc "We begin by slow-cooking the potatoes in a luxurious duck fat confit, allowing them to absorb the rich flavors and achieve an unparalleled tenderness."
    mc "我们首先将马铃薯慢炖在丰满的鸭油中，让它们吸收浓郁的风味，达到无与伦比的柔软口感。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4685
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_103cd6f0:

    # mc "Atop the confit potato, you'll find our gourmet burger patty, crafted from prime cuts of beef and seasoned to perfection with our secret blend of herbs and spices."
    mc "在鸭油炖马铃薯的上方，是我们的精制汉堡肉饼，选用上等牛肉精心制作，再配上我们秘制的草药和香料进行完美调味。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4686
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_eae2764d:

    # mc "This succulent patty is then seared to a beautiful medium-rare, ensuring a tender and juicy bite."
    mc "然后，这块美味的肉饼会被煎至美妙的五分熟，确保每一口都鲜嫩多汁。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4689
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_217e38fd:

    # mc "The crowning glory of this dish is our unique yellow sauce."
    mc "这道菜的亮点是我们独特的黄色酱汁。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4690
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_8e8c9acf:

    # mc "It combines the tangy notes of Dijon mustard with the velvety smoothness of hollandaise, infused with a hint of saffron for a subtle, earthy undertone."
    mc "它结合了第戎芥末的酸味和荷兰风味酱的细腻口感，又融入了一丝藏红花的微妙土壤气息。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4691
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_bfcd162c:

    # mc "This delectable sauce brings the dish together, creating a harmonious blend of flavors that will delight your palate."
    mc "这款美味的酱汁将整道菜调和在一起，创造出能让您的味蕾欢欣雀跃的口感和风味。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4692
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_67a729e7:

    # mc "We recommend savoring each bite, taking in the symphony of flavors and textures."
    mc "我们建议细细品尝每一口，体验其中的风味和质感的交织。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4695
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_b6a0aa73:

    # mc "To complement the rich flavors and textures of our Confit Potato and Gourmet Burger Patty with yellow sauce..."
    mc "为了搭配这道鸭油炖马铃薯和搭配了黄色酱汁精制汉堡肉饼的丰富风味和质地……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4696
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_020e7840:

    # mc "I would highly recommend our elegant and full-bodied Red Wine."
    mc "我强烈推荐我们这款优雅而醇厚的红葡萄酒。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4697
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_780a07c0:

    # mc "This wine boasts notes of dark fruits, such as blackcurrant and black cherry, along with subtle hints of cedar and vanilla from oak barrel aging."
    mc "这款葡萄酒具有黑醋栗和黑樱桃等深色水果的香气，还暗藏着橡木桶陈酿所带来的雪松和香草的微妙味道。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4698
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_faeaa640:

    # mc "The wine's firm tannins and balanced acidity will beautifully cut through the dish's richness, creating a harmonious and delightful pairing."
    mc "酒体的坚实单宁和平衡的酸度能够完美地衬托出菜肴的丰富口感，是极其和谐、愉悦的搭配。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4699
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_71c46ef2:

    # mc "{cps=20}Bon appétit!"
    mc "{cps=20}祝您用餐愉快！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4702
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_bc717081:

    # emi "Hm, you know your ingredients. But how about the taste?"
    emi "哼，你对原料很了解。但是味道如何呢？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4705
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_3eb0bf33_4:

    # emi "..."
    emi "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4712
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_6138412d:

    # emi "*exhales deeply*"
    emi "*长舒一口气*"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4713
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_926ae3d3:

    # yt "Just an exhale?! Give me more, damn it!"
    yt "才叹一口气？！再多来点反应啊！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4716
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_8105e702:

    # emi "After taking a bite, I can appreciate the creativity and effort put into this."
    emi "尝了一口之后，我确实能体会到这道菜里的创意与努力。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4717
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_07f97d1c:

    # emi "The potatoes are tender, and the burger patty is well-seasoned."
    emi "土豆很嫩，汉堡肉饼的调味也恰到好处。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4718
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_3e30a6fe:

    # yt "Nice!"
    yt "很好！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4719
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_0f78f0ee:

    # emi "However, the yellow sauce, while interesting, could use a bit more balance."
    emi "但是，黄色酱汁虽然有趣，却需要更好的平衡。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4720
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_5b9e1259:

    # emi "The tanginess slightly overpowers the other flavors in the dish."
    emi "其中的酸味略微盖过了菜里的其他味道。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4721
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_8d140b92:

    # emi "Perhaps more creaminess or a hint of sweetness would round out the sauce and harmonize the dish entire."
    emi "或许增加一些奶油感，或者微微再甜一些，能让酱汁更加圆润，与整道菜融合得更好。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4722
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_507f560f:

    # yt "Shit! I should've spent more time with the sauce!"
    yt "操！我应该在酱汁上再多花点时间的！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4725
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_b8cb0b73:

    # emi "You were surely underestimating me. I am not someone who is impressed by anybody so easily."
    emi "你绝对是小看我了。我可不会轻易被打动。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4726
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4728
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_7accee61:

    # emi "Don't get too disheartened about it. You are not a chef."
    emi "不用太灰心丧气。你也不是厨师。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4729
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_fa513b8d:

    # emi "I was only criticizing your food..."
    emi "我只是在评价你做的菜而已……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4732
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d11b78e9:

    # emi "I didn't say I didn't like it... [mc]."
    emi "我没有说我不喜欢吃……[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4735
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4a1c0374:

    # yt "Whoa, did I just get a smile from her? She even called me by my name!"
    yt "哇，她刚刚是对我笑了吗？甚至还叫了我的名字！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4738
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_06c7b801:

    # gl "That's our cue. Let's leave them alone for now."
    gl "这样就行了。先让他们两个单独谈谈吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4739
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_b9facd87:

    # g "You don't want to hear what they're going to talk about?"
    g "你不想听他们接下来要说的话吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4740
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_b94c8137:

    # gl "I want to know, but this is their time, not ours."
    gl "我当然想，不过现在是只属于他们的时间，与咱们俩无关。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4741
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_65323db5:

    # g "If you say so."
    g "那好吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4744
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_7a6b7f24:

    # emi "Now, a deal is a deal. I will at least listen to what you have to say."
    emi "我遵守诺言，至少会听听你有什么要说的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4747
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d21b324f:

    # mc "Thanks, Emilda. And I'm glad you liked what I prepared for you."
    mc "谢谢，埃米尔达。还有，你能喜欢我做的菜，我很高兴。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4748
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_dbfab891:

    # emi "You're lucky I'm in a generous mood right now, young man. I just finished my daily Bible reading before coming down here."
    emi "你很幸运，我现在心情不错，年轻人。我下来之前刚读完今天要读的圣经。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4749
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_d8c1f819:

    # yt "Hey, she's not unreasonable at all. She may have a proper rationale for everything she's done."
    yt "哎，她根本就没有不讲理啊。或许她做的一切都是有合理的原因的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4754
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_f21cd8fd:

    # emi "I will let you sleep here tonight. I'm not so evil as to let you go through the dangerous roads in this area in the dark."
    emi "我今晚允许你睡在这里。我也不忍心让你在晚上走那片危险的地方回去。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4755
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_be9e2bbc:

    # emi "However, I want you to leave first thing tomorrow."
    emi "但是，我想让你明天一早立马离开。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4756
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_c88cd2cf:

    # emi "Lastly, as part of our deal, leave Gwen and my family alone."
    emi "最后，就像我们说好的那样，不要再靠近格温和我的家人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4759
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_85d1c613:

    # gl "*sighs*"
    gl "*叹气*"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4760
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_94b0292f:

    # g "We tried, dad. I knew this wouldn't work in the first place."
    g "我们尽力了，老爸。我一开始就知道不可能行得通的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4761
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_f7d53c5e:

    # gl "What about you and [mc] now?"
    gl "你跟[mc!t]之后要怎么办？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4762
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_4b340443_2:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4765
translate chinese klaradrunkshow_2f44d764:

    # g "I guess we'll see..."
    g "到时候再说吧……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4778
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_8d3535c9:

    # emi "Sit, and sit properly."
    emi "坐吧，好好坐好。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4782
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_35caffc8:

    # emi "Your cooking was impressive given that you are not a chef."
    emi "考虑到你并非专业的厨师，你的厨艺还是很出色的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4783
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_85350c24:

    # emi "You know your ingredients and your flavors. Where did you learn?"
    emi "你对原料和风味都有挺深的了解。是从哪里学的？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4787
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_b38ae699:

    # mc "Ah, [landlady] used to work abroad when we were kids, so my [roommate] and I were forced to cook on our own."
    mc "啊，[landlady!t]在我和我[roommate!t]小时候常年在国外工作，所以我和她只能自己做饭。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4788
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_061115c4:

    # mc "We'd look into her secret recipes or through cookbooks. Sometimes, we'd search online."
    mc "我们有时候会看菜谱，有时候会上网搜索。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4789
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_80753a6d:

    # mc "All those years of trial and error provided me with the knowledge I have for food."
    mc "多年来的经验让我对做饭有了不少了解。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4792
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c5e6c711:

    # emi "I see, that's interesting."
    emi "原来如此，有意思。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4793
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_8cac4b4f:

    # emi "If given a chance, I would like to meet your [landlady]."
    emi "如果有机会的话，我想见见你[landlady!t]。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4794
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_0a81678e:

    # mc "I can arrange something."
    mc "我可以安排一下。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4795
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_3b5a6e27:

    # emi "Don't bother for now."
    emi "目前就先不必了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4796
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_ef1eab9d:

    # emi "So, I assume you want to know what happened?"
    emi "你是想知道我们家到底发生了什么吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4797
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_95b9dfec:

    # mc "Glenn already told me what happened to you guys back then and that it was because of me."
    mc "格伦以前已经跟我说过发生了什么事了，也说了是因为我。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4800
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_a17c044a:

    # mc "Sorry if I sound condescending, but I want to know your reason for casting Gwen out and going as far as to divorce Glenn."
    mc "抱歉，我这么问可能有点居高临下了，不过我想知道你为什么要把格温赶走，甚至还和格伦离了婚。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4801
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_e8444d54:

    # mc "What was on your mind? What did you think when you made those decisions?"
    mc "你是怎么想的？是什么让你做出了那些决定？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4802
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_e70fcc3b:

    # mc "I got the gist of it, but I want to hear it from you directly without any pride in the way."
    mc "我心里有大概的猜测，但我想听你直截了当地说出来，不要为了自尊做任何修饰。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4805
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_e86fd17c:

    # emi "Are you planning to reconcile my family? If so, I'd suggest you give it up."
    emi "你是想让我们家重归于好吗？如果是的话，我建议你放弃吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4806
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_b057f41d:

    # emi "You saw our current state. I can't see a bright side to any of this."
    emi "你也看到了我们现在的样子。我根本看不到任何希望。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4807
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_451eac65:

    # emi "So there is no point in telling you."
    emi "所以我告诉你也没有用。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4810
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_25356c1b:

    # mc "Perhaps.{w} But what's important to me is to know you better."
    mc "可能吧。{w}但对我来说，重要的是更加了解你。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4811
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_ae82690b:

    # mc "I've come to understand both Gwen and Glenn. The only person left is you."
    mc "我已经理解了格温和格伦。只剩下你了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4814
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_197f5721:

    # emi "And what are you going to do after this?"
    emi "那这之后你打算做什么呢？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4815
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_2d58d572:

    # mc "*chuckles* Nothing but celebrate your birthday. All three of us came here for that reason."
    mc "*轻笑* 当然是给你过生日啊。我们三个都是为此而来的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4818
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_3eb0bf33:

    # emi "..."
    emi "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4821
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c26d9b37:

    # emi "Why bother?"
    emi "有什么必要呢？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4822
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_b2f1cfd0:

    # emi "I stopped celebrating my birthday so long ago that I forgot it was tomorrow."
    emi "我早就已经不过生日了，甚至都已经忘了明天是我的生日。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4823
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c7939c46:

    # yt "I was right."
    yt "我猜得没错。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4826
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_b73ca366:

    # mc "... You've got no one to celebrate it with, do you?"
    mc "……因为没有人和你一起庆祝，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4829
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_6e28ef0d:

    # emi "There is still a thick wall between you and me, [mc]. Don't forget."
    emi "你和我之间依然还有一堵厚厚的墙，[mc!t]。别忘了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4832
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_8ac63fcc:

    # yt "That's the tone I want. Let's say something to bait her in..."
    yt "我就是想要这种语调。说点话引她上钩吧……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4835
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_19a2e593:

    # mc "I apologize. I stepped out of line."
    mc "我向你道歉，是我越界了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4836
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f89214d2:

    # mc "However, you said you don't see a bright side. But if you ask me, {i}you{/i} are the bright side of your family."
    mc "不过，你刚刚说你看不到希望。但要我说的话，{i}你{/i}就是你们家的希望。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4837
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_d8ca5e39:

    # emi "What are you trying to say?"
    emi "你想表达什么？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4840
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_bc0c964e:

    # yt "I need something that will contradict her beliefs to crack her open..."
    yt "我要说些和她的观念相反的话，打开一个缺口……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4841
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_12fdd4dd:

    # yt "Let's go [landlady] mode."
    yt "进入[landlady!t]模式吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4844
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c0c69ff9:

    # mc "If you spoon-feed your student, they will never learn, Emilda."
    mc "如果让学生什么都按你说的做，那他们什么也学不到，埃米尔达。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4845
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_4cc441ef:

    # emi "Hm, alright, keep your secrets. Regardless, I'm afraid I have to disagree."
    emi "嗯，好吧，你不想说就不说。不管怎样，恐怕我都不能同意你的说法。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4848
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_6ec5ac02:

    # emi "Making someone learn should always be systematic. A course that everyone can follow."
    emi "让人学习应该是系统性的。要对每个人都适用。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4849
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_ee5592ad:

    # emi "I grew up in a family where systems, rules, and discipline were the keys to one's future and well-being."
    emi "我出生在一个制度、规则、纪律极其重要的家庭里。这些东西是人的未来与幸福的关键。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4850
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_49f78bff:

    # emi "In my family, we believe that by adhering to these systems, one can achieve success and happiness."
    emi "我的家庭的信条是，只有遵守这些，才能成功、幸福。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4853
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_29a952db:

    # emi "Perhaps my methods were too rigid, but I truly believed that by enforcing discipline, I was doing what was best for my family."
    emi "或许我的方法太刻板了，但我真心认为，强调纪律性对我们家来说是最好的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4854
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_a3782fc8:

    # emi "I never thought my strictness would push them away, leaving me all alone."
    emi "我从来没有想过我的严厉会把他们都逼走。只剩下我一个人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4855
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_ec133b82:

    # emi "Maybe it's hard for you to understand, but that is how I was raised."
    emi "或许你很难理解，但我就是这样长大的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4856
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_9e331168:

    # emi "I thought it was the only way to secure a bright future for Gwen."
    emi "我以为只有这种方法才能给格温带来光明的未来。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4859
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_385b3f74:

    # emi "If you don't follow our ways, you'll never have friends, support, or the connections needed to thrive in this world."
    emi "如果你不按我们的方法来，就永远不会有朋友，支持，或者出人头地需要的人脉。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4860
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_0e7b903e:

    # emi "People like you who refuse to conform may find temporary happiness."
    emi "像你这样拒绝遵守规则的人或许能找到暂时的快乐。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4861
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_e65f3f55:

    # emi "But in the long run, you'll be left behind, struggling to catch up with those who played by the rules."
    emi "但长远来看，你就会被落下，用尽全力也赶不上遵守规则的人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4864
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_bb8011e7:

    # emi "Now look what Gwen has become."
    emi "看看格温现在成了什么样子。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4865
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_cc14d468:

    # emi "A vulgar woman with a major lack of respect."
    emi "一个丝毫不懂尊重，粗俗的女人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4866
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c403a88b:

    # emi "I wanted to protect her from the harsh realities of the world, from being taken advantage of or making mistakes that would affect her future."
    emi "我想保护她，让她不被这个世界残酷的现实所伤害，不让她被利用，或者犯下可能影响到她的未来的错误。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4867
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_bcc98109:

    # emi "But instead, my attempts to control her only pushed her further away."
    emi "可事实却恰恰相反，我对她的控制只让我们两个渐行渐远。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4870
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_b65c4f87:

    # emi "When I heard about Gwen losing her maidenhood to a no-name high schooler without any reputation, I was devastated."
    emi "当我听说格温居然把她的贞操给了一个毫无名声的无名高中生的时候，我真的万念俱灰。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4871
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f926f390:

    # emi "I had done everything in my power up to that point to guide her on the right path, yet she still made choices I couldn't accept."
    emi "我做了我力所能及的一切，想让她走上正确的道路，可她依然做出了我无法接受的选择。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4872
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_e5c8c45a:

    # emi "I felt like a failure as a mother, and I couldn't fathom why my system didn't work with her."
    emi "我感觉我作为一个母亲，是彻头彻尾的失败，我也不明白为什么我的方法在她身上不起作用。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4873
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_90f1d941:

    # emi "Maybe I was too harsh, but I only wanted the best for her, for our family."
    emi "或许我太严厉了，但我只想给她，给我们的家，带来最好的结果。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4874
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_7ff23ccc:

    # emi "I didn't want them to suffer the consequences of poor decisions, and I didn't want them to be left behind in a competitive world."
    emi "我不想让他们承受做出错误的选择的后果，我也不想让他们在这竞争激烈的世界上被人甩在后面。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4875
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_a80babc5:

    # emi "But now I realize that in my quest to protect them, I might have done more harm than good."
    emi "但现在我意识到了，我在保护他们的过程中，给他们造成的伤害要多于好处。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4878
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_5d8beb97:

    # emi "That being said, I never considered my ways as wrong, and I never will."
    emi "尽管如此，我从来没有认为我的方法是错的，我也永远不会那么认为。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4879
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_bee4ccb5:

    # emi "That is my {i}pride{/i} as-{w=0.7}{nw}"
    emi "这是我的{i}自傲{/i}，是我作为——{w=0.7}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4882
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_3eb0bf33_1:

    # emi "..."
    emi "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4885
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_dfdd7cc2:

    # emi "How did you..."
    emi "你是怎么……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4886
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_72ae8b4c:

    # mc "I baited you in and triggered you with a point of contention."
    mc "我设了一个圈套，用你不同意的观点骗出了你的看法。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4887
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_94f01c7a:

    # mc "Getting someone riled up gives them a reason to respond, especially when they have a strong sense of pride."
    mc "激怒别人，就给了他们回应你的理由，特别是对于自尊心强的人来说更是如此。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4888
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f08898d8:

    # mc "I just nudged you into sharing what I wanted to hear since our conversation started, and you did."
    mc "从我们一开始说话，我就在引导你把我想知道的事告诉我，你也确实告诉我了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4891
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_1a12119a:

    # e "Yes, you'll need it, but once you learn the methods behind it, please use this technique wisely and responsibly."
    e "是的，你以后能用得上，不过你学会了这个方法以后，一定要谨慎、负责任地使用。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4892
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_e5f13dcc:

    # e "It can backfire if the other person feels they've been tricked or forced into revealing more than they were comfortable with."
    e "如果对方觉得被骗了，或者说了太多不想说的事，可能还会造成反效果。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4893
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_2051d66a:

    # mc "Understood."
    mc "明白了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4896
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c2c6a127:

    # emi "Hahahahaa~! How amusing!"
    emi "哈哈哈哈哈~！真有意思啊！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4899
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_661e6a59:

    # emi "*sighs* \"Eliciting information\". Very bold, but I must admit, it's impressive."
    emi "*叹气* “信息引诱”。很大胆，不过我必须承认，也很出色。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4900
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_6e9f0d19:

    # emi "Alright, you've triumphed over me again and, yet again, obtained what you wanted."
    emi "好吧，你又赢过我一次，并且也又一次完成了目标。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4901
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_a2f7c9f3:

    # emi "You're starting to earn my respect, so I'll allow you to converse with me more casually. But watch your words, dear."
    emi "你开始取得我的尊重了，所以我允许你和我谈话时再随意些。不过你还是要谨言慎行，亲爱的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4902
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c2cf2978:

    # yt "Thanks, Em. All your advice and training paid off... Somehow."
    yt "谢谢，小艾。你的建议和训练最后都派上用场了……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4905
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_dc4579dd:

    # mc "So it's \"dear\" now? I'm not sure I've earned that yet."
    mc "现在是“亲爱的”了？我应该还没到那种程度吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4906
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_155755f4:

    # emi "Believe me, nobody -and I mean nobody- has ever made my mouth open up like that. You've earned it."
    emi "相信我，没有人——真的没有一个人——能让我把嘴巴长那么大过。你绝对值得。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4907
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_2a725cd6:

    # mc "Thanks, Emilda. But... aren't you upset by what I did?"
    mc "谢谢，埃米尔达。不过……我做的事没有让你觉得生气吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4910
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_91d39761:

    # emi "That's the reaction you were expecting?"
    emi "你以为我会生气吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4911
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_06097ca0:

    # mc "Well, yeah..."
    mc "是啊……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4912
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_29abf1f3:

    # emi "Under different circumstances, I might have been."
    emi "如果是其他场合的话，我是可能会生气。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4913
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_03a51343:

    # emi "However, candidly speaking, your food offering softened me up to your wiles."
    emi "但是，坦率地说，你做的菜让我也可以接受你的欺骗了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4914
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_2a35a1bc:

    # emi "Whether that was intentional or not, it deserves recognition."
    emi "不管是不是有意的，都值得赞赏。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:4915
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_a49715db:

    # emi "So, what can this old lady do for you now?"
