translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_ec81aede:

    # g "*whispers* Fifty."
    g "*低语* 五十。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5164
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_549c4f5d:

    # mc "I mean, you only turn fifty once, right?"
    mc "一辈子也就50岁一次，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5165
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_3728c779:

    # emi "I guess so..."
    emi "也是……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5166
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_d2f3108c:

    # mc "You know, they say life begins at fifty! And look at you: you're practically aging in reverse!"
    mc "你看，大家都说，人生到了50岁才刚开始呢！再瞧瞧你，真是在逆生长！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5169
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_0be43450:

    # emi "*giggles* Oh, stop it! But do go on..."
    emi "*笑* 噢，别说了！不过再多说点也可以……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5173
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_2d941545:

    # g "What the hell was that giggle supposed to mean?!"
    g "你这笑起来了是什么意思？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5175
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_359de78d:

    # mc "You're like a fine wine - you just get better with age!"
    mc "你就像是美酒一样——随着年岁增长只会越来越好！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5176
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_3c279737:

    # emi "You're deliberately flattering this old woman, aren't you?"
    emi "你是在故意奉承我这个老女人吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5177
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_0941e21a:

    # mc "Uh, no...?"
    mc "呃，不是啊……？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5183
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_3e7241a3:

    # emi "Well? I did not tell you to stop, did I?"
    emi "没了？我也没叫你停下吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5186
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_68038b43:

    # mc "I must say, your beauty is simply timeless."
    mc "不得不说，你的美貌真是不受时间的影响。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5187
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_0dead07d:

    # mc "I mean, look at your radiant skin and those sparkling eyes - they could easily pass for someone in their thirties!"
    mc "你这红润的皮肤，炯炯有神的双眼——连二三十岁的人也比不上你啊！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5188
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_ed5364e9:

    # emi "*giggles* Oh, you're really laying it on thick, aren't you?"
    emi "*笑* 噢，你说得也太夸张了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5189
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f0289907:

    # mc "Well, it's only fitting for a woman as stunning as you."
    mc "像你这么漂亮的女人，必须这么夸才对呀。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5190
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_3cd880a8:

    # mc "And have you noticed how your hair seems to have its natural highlights?"
    mc "还有你的头发，真是天生的抢眼！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5191
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_d8591da9:

    # mc "It's like you've discovered the secret to eternal youth!"
    mc "就好像发现了永葆青春的秘诀一样！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5192
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c2c71893:

    # emi "Oh, stop! You're making me blush."
    emi "噢，别说了别说了！我都要脸红了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5193
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_fefde7ef:

    # g "Seriously?"
    g "认真的？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5196
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_8fdf7c78:

    # mc "And Emilda, have you seen how toned and fit you are?"
    mc "还有埃米尔达，你的身材也很好啊！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5197
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_ddebbc56:

    # mc "You could easily give those fitness influencers a run for their money! It's truly inspiring!"
    mc "都可以给那些健身网红们开班上课了！太厉害了！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5198
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f7c1eb91:

    # emi "Well, I try to eat healthily and stay active as much as possible between my bible studies."
    emi "嗯，我一直都吃得很健康，也会在研究圣经的空档里多运动。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5199
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_75e952bc:

    # g "Oh boy..."
    g "天啊……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5200
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f2dc5859:

    # mc "And one last thing. Your sense of style is absolutely on point."
    mc "还有最后一点。你的时尚感真是太在点子上了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5201
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_03460303:

    # mc "You always look effortlessly chic, no matter the occasion. You're a true fashion icon in our eyes."
    mc "不管什么场合，你根本都不用费事就能打扮得很时髦。在我们眼里，你就是真正的时尚风向标啊。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5202
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_07303995:

    # g "You mean {i}your{/i} eyes."
    g "你是说在{i}你{/i}眼里吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5203
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_b0d406b4:

    # emi "Oh, thank you, dear. You've made me feel extraordinary today."
    emi "哎呀，谢谢你，亲爱的。你让我特别开心。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5204
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_2d0b3c44:

    # g "Jesus Christ. So this is how you won her over...?"
    g "我的天啊。你就是这样跟她搞好关系的……？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5207
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_65c1f2d0:

    # mc "Special? We're not there yet."
    mc "开心？这才刚开始呢。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5210
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5211
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_fe7f8da5:

    # g "Mhm."
    g "嗯。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5215
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_bfd02199_1:

    # mc "I heard from Gwen you enjoy massages, apart from food."
    mc "我听格温说你除了美食之外，还喜欢按摩。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5216
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_abb27215_1:

    # mc "I'm not an expert, but my technique can still help you relax."
    mc "我不算专家，但也能帮你放松一下。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5217
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_ad0eadba_1:

    # emi "Is that so? You've certainly done your homework."
    emi "是吗？看来你的确下了不少功夫。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5221
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_8a56bedd:

    # mc "Let me just ask one more thing..."
    mc "我就只再问一个问题……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5222
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_4e1508ff:

    # emi "Hm?"
    emi "嗯？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5223
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_5b2e5019:

    # mc "Do you know how Gwen is currently living right now?"
    mc "你知道格温现在的生活是什么样子吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5226
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c5f58ae6:

    # emi "No, I don't. Although, I'm certain she must be a mess and a headache to you."
    emi "我不知道。但是，她肯定让你很头疼吧。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5229
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_dd5ff496:

    # mc "No, Emilda. Gwen has played a huge role in who I am now."
    mc "不，埃米尔达。我能是今天这个样子，有很大一部分是因为格温。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5230
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_ae0cf872:

    # mc "Wherever my life leads me, she will always be a part of me."
    mc "不管我的生活变成什么样，她都一直会是我的一部分。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5231
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_d8ca5e39_1:

    # emi "What are you trying to say?"
    emi "你想表达什么？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5232
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_ee80e162:

    # mc "If given the opportunity, would you be willing to make up with Gwen?"
    mc "如果有机会的话，你愿意和格温和好吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5235
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_3eb0bf33_2:

    # emi "..."
    emi "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5238
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_1326c341:

    # emi "Yes."
    emi "我愿意。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5239
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_75b797e3:

    # emi "I never consider my ways wrong, but..."
    emi "我从来没觉得我的方法是错的，但是……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5240
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_efdaadb4:

    # emi "There are times when my conscience makes me question what I did to her."
    emi "我的良心经常让我思考，我对她做过的事。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5241
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_95fb2614:

    # emi "Was I justified, or was I too much? Was it worth losing her for the sake of my pride?"
    emi "那样是正当的吗，还是说我太过分了？为了维持我的自尊失去她，这值得吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5242
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_93c1fa09:

    # emi "She's my only child and my most prized treasure."
    emi "她是我唯一的孩子，我最珍贵的宝物。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5243
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_ace97be0:

    # emi "Even if it's been so long that the odds are near zero, I would like to take the chance to have her in my arms again."
    emi "即使过了这么久，即使几率近乎于零，我还是想再次把她拥入怀中。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5246
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_5ea54d88:

    # g "Is that so...?"
    g "真的吗……？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5247
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_4033f4ba:

    # mc "Yeah, she said it herself."
    mc "是啊，她亲口说的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5248
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_4b340443_1:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5251
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c944a1b6:

    # g "[mc]... can you bring them here?"
    g "[mc!t]……你能把他们带来吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5252
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_1ef706f6:

    # mc "Who?"
    mc "谁？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5253
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f50ed224:

    # g "Everyone."
    g "大家。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5254
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_3ab6b5ed:

    # mc "Well, it's not out of the question. But what are you planning to do?"
    mc "好吧，也不是不行。不过你打算做什么？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5257
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_faf14b5e:

    # g "I will make her understand..."
    g "我要让她理解……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5258
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_98d29c1c:

    # g "It has to be me..."
    g "只有我才可以……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5273
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_6eff54d2:

    # shu "Ahoy, lads and lasses! The almighty gang has arrived!"
    shu "你们好，女士们先生们！全能天团来啦！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5275
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_a51c77bb:

    # emi "A-aah, why so many people at once? What's happening?"
    emi "啊-啊啊，怎么一下子来了这么多人？发生什么了？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5278
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_e51fbe9a:

    # g "This is my birthday present to you... mom."
    g "这是我送你的生日礼物……妈妈。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5281
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_a0354bb1:

    # g "These are my friends, the people who have been there with me through thick and thin and have accepted me for who I am with open arms."
    g "这些就是我的朋友们，是他们陪着我一起披荆斩棘，张开双臂接受了最真实的我。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5282
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_1d68ec43:

    # g "They've helped me grow and become the woman I am today, even after I rejected your \"path to success\" or whatever you might call it."
    g "是他们帮助我成长，变成今天的样子，哪怕是在我拒绝了你的“成功之路”之后，或者随便你怎么叫，也是一样。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5285
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_30597de5:

    # a "I would say instead that you've been there for {i}us{/i}. I cannot even count the times you've set us straight."
    a "我觉得是你陪着我们才对。我都数不清你帮了我们多少次了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5286
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_7cf83713:

    # e "Mhm, I agree. Gwen is like the gang's pillar. A critical foundation that never asks for recognition."
    e "嗯，我同意。格温就像是我们这群人的支柱一样。是默默支撑，从不邀功的根基。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5289
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c16f29f3:

    # a "By the way, good morning and happy birthday, Mrs. Wilson. My name is Aine."
    a "对了，早上好，生日快乐，威尔森女士。我叫艾妮。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5290
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f196cdf7:

    # a "Emma and I have only met you once before, but you're still as pretty as since the last time we saw you."
    a "我和艾玛之前只见过你一次，但你依然和我们上次见到你的时候一样漂亮。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5291
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_7a9b53c8:

    # emi "T-thank you, dear."
    emi "谢-谢谢你，亲爱的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5294
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_9731d91f:

    # e "Happy birthday, Mrs. Wilson. I'm Emma."
    e "生日快乐，威尔森女士。我是艾玛。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5295
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_608596e0:

    # e "I apologize. We don't have gifts for you since Mr. Wilson told us to hurry when he woke us all up."
    e "我要道个歉。威尔森先生把我们喊起来的时候，让我们一定要快，过于匆忙，就没有准备礼物。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5296
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_57063b3c:

    # e "It's such a pleasure to see you again."
    e "很高兴能再次见到你。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5297
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_aeb46391:

    # emi "Oh, uh... Don't worry about it, dear. It's okay."
    emi "哦，呃……不用担心礼物的事，亲爱的。没关系的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5301
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_0173263e:

    # shu "Ahhh...! Happy birthday to you, Mrs. Wilson. My name is Shu. I'm [mc]'s best friend."
    shu "啊啊……！祝你生日快乐，威尔森女士。我的名字是修。我是[mc!t]最好的朋友。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5302
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c3c00d64:

    # emi "Where is this light coming from?"
    emi "这灯光是从哪来的？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5303
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_cd14bb28:

    # shu "This is the first time we've met, but still, I must say your beauty is truly breathtaking."
    shu "这是我们第一次见面，但我必须承认，你的美丽真是令人惊叹。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5307
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_a67e95b4:

    # shu "It's as if the heavens have graced us with the presence of a divine goddess, sending you here to live among us, mere mortals."
    shu "宛如天堂赐予我们一位神圣的女神，派你来与我们这些凡人同住一样。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5308
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_565982eb:

    # shu "Your radiance shines brighter than the sun, casting a warm glow that fills the hearts of everyone in this sacred landscape."
    shu "你的光芒比太阳还要明亮，投射出温暖的光辉，填满了这片神圣的风景中每个人的心灵。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5309
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_d59fd07b:

    # shu "Your eyes, deep and enchanting like the night sky, draw us in and hold us captive with their magnetic allure."
    shu "你的眼睛深邃而迷人，就像夜空一样吸引着我们，用其中蕴含的磁力将我们俘虏。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5312
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_0bd48b30:

    # shu "Your smile could tame the wildest of beasts and bring peace to even the stormiest of seas."
    shu "你的微笑能够驯服最狂野的野兽，给暴风雨最肆虐的海洋带来平静。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5314
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_0777d9b0:

    # shu "In all my years sailing the vast oceans, I've never encountered a beauty so captivating and mesmerizing as yours."
    shu "在我漫游浩瀚的海洋的许多年里，都从未遇到过像你这样如此令人着迷的美人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5315
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_54e10a44:

    # shu "On this special day, we are all truly-{w=0.8}{nw}"
    shu "在这特别的一天，我们全都真诚地——{w=0.8}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5322
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_d485dd04:

    # g "Too long and unrealistic! NEXT!"
    g "太长太假了！下一个！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5325
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_78d663c0:

    # n "G'day, Emilda! I'm Naomi, a mate of Gwen's. Just wanted to say happy birthday and introduce meself."
    n "你好，埃米尔达！我是娜奥米，格温的一个朋友。我就是来说一句生日快乐，再介绍一下自己。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5328
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f076bb9c:

    # emi "Oh, hello there, Naomi."
    emi "噢，你好，娜奥米。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5329
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_43b7b163:

    # emi "Your accent, are you from Cesa Cityside?"
    emi "你的口音……你是从塞萨那边来的吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5330
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_47e00f2d:

    # n "Yeah! Although I work home maintenance in Golden City, so I currently live there."
    n "是的！不过我在金城做室内维修的工作，所以目前住在那里。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5331
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f4685d89:

    # emi "That sounds interesting. It's rare for a woman to take that kind of job nowadays."
    emi "有意思。现如今很少有女人做那种工作了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5334
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_8d862674:

    # n "Yeah, but it's a beaut of a job and I love it. Plus, livin' in Golden City is an absolute corker."
    n "是啊，不过这工作很有意思，我很喜欢。而且，住在金城绝对是美事一桩。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5335
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f8239b96:

    # emi "Let's talk later. I have friends from Cesa: perhaps you may know them."
    emi "是的，我们之后再聊吧。我在塞萨也有朋友，说不定你认识他们。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5336
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_abf2c785:

    # n "Absolutely!"
    n "好的！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5339
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_e4bc09e1:

    # mc "Your accent is pretty strong today, Naomi. What gives?"
    mc "你的口音今天很重啊，娜奥米。怎么了？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5340
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_574de795:

    # n "My inner bogan comes out when I'm excited. It's my first time at a party."
    n "我兴奋的时候说话就带口音。这是我第一次参加派对。（译注：再次提醒玩家们，娜奥米有澳大利亚口音。这是无法在翻译中表现出来的。）"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5341
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c6993fa4:

    # mc "Are you serious?!"
    mc "真的吗？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5344
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_43842ba9:

    # g "Hey, short stacks! Introduce yourselves!"
    g "哎，小矮子们！来做自我介绍了！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5347
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_82c70659:

    # m "Hi, my name is Moon. I'm [mc]'s bodyguard."
    m "嗨，我叫月。我是[mc!t]的保镖。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5348
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_b7399fc8:

    # emi "Bodyguard?"
    emi "保镖？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5350
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_1e813ccb:

    # emi "You have a bodyguard?"
    emi "你还有保镖？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5351
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_9e198818:

