    mc "你病了吗？吃错什么东西了？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5804
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_e57485c2:

    # g "No, I'm writing a song."
    g "没有，我在写歌。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5807
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_b5b308b9:

    # mc "A... song? The heck?"
    mc "写……歌？真的？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5810
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_530c1eb5:

    # mc "So you sing?"
    mc "那你会唱歌咯？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5811
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_651603f8:

    # g "Not really. It's just for fun, you know?"
    g "也不是。只是写着玩的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5812
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_cafe958c:

    # g "But I can't properly express what I want to write in words."
    g "但是我没办法把我心里想的东西用词语表达出来。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5815
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_e1a6e5f4:

    # mc "Let me see."
    mc "让我看看。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5816
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5819
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f912812c:

    # mc "It's good! Who are you dedicating this to?"
    mc "写的很好啊！这歌是写给谁的？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5822
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_4b340443_3:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5824
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_da83cf23:

    # g "Tch, the hell do you mean who am I dedicating it to? I told you, it's only for fun."
    g "切，什么写给谁的，你什么意思啊？我都说了，是写着玩的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5825
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_2d4a063a:

    # mc "Well, artists always have certain inspirations for their songs."
    mc "嗯，歌手写歌，总是有灵感来源的嘛。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5826
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_e3eda796:

    # mc "Plus, the amount of \"you\" and \"your\" in the lyrics suggests that you're writing it for someone."
    mc "再说了，你在歌词里用了特别多“你”和“你的”，不就代表你是写给某个人的吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5827
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_9b01b78f:

    # mc "Are you brokenhearted or what?"
    mc "你是失恋了还是怎么？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5830
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_32e9b22e:

    # g "... I am."
    g "……是的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5831
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_5f260b2e:

    # mc "So you've had a boyfriend? Why didn't you tell me?"
    mc "所以你谈过男朋友？为什么不告诉我？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5832
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_ca297e72:

    # g "Why would I?"
    g "我为啥要告诉你？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5833
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_5e44a000:

    # mc "Right..."
    mc "也是……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5836
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_4b340443_4:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5839
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_1f2139a6:

    # g "Do you... want to help me write that?"
    g "你想……帮我写吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5840
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_cfce055e:

    # mc "Are you sure?"
    mc "确定吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5843
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_2f80f75c:

    # g "Yeah, since we're graduating in a couple of weeks, this..."
    g "是啊，我们过几个星期就要毕业了，这应该……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5844
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_fbaaa196:

    # g "... Is going to be last my memory of you."
    g "……会是我关于你最后的记忆了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5855
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_cbd7944a:

    # g "*whispers* I wish we could spend more time like this. But I don't know what you're so afraid of..."
    g "*低语* 要是我们能多共度一些时光该多好。可是我不知道你到底在怕什么……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5856
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_4e9b7315:

    # g "*whispers* If you feel the same way, then fucking tell me, idiot..."
    g "*低语* 如果你也有一样的感觉，那就他妈的告诉我啊，傻子……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5859
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_4b340443_5:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5862
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_4d20f4fb:

    # g "*whispers* Or... am I the one who's afraid?"
    g "*低语* 还是说……害怕的人是我？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5863
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_d8ec0f80:

    # g "*whispers* Come on, dude... why am I like this when it comes to him?"
    g "*低语* 天啊……为什么一跟他扯上关系我就会变成这样？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5864
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_4d34cbb1:

    # g "*sighs*"
    g "*叹气*"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5867
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_b64da1cf:

    # g "Hey, [mc]. Wake up."
    g "喂，[mc!t]。醒醒。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5868
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_0a017d92_1:

    # mc "Hmmm?"
    mc "嗯嗯？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5871
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_8ba0af13:

    # g "Check this out."
    g "你看一下。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5872
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5873
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_288248c7:

    # g "What do you think?"
    g "觉得怎么样？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5876
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_5271d14b:

    # mc "That looks great if it's a finished product, but... isn't it too short?"
    mc "如果这是成品的话，挺不错的，不过……是不是有点太短了？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5877
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_2e90c01c:

    # g "It's more than enough for a slow rhythm acoustic song."
    g "对于一首慢节奏，用原声吉他配乐的歌来说，这已经足够了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5878
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_59940cde:

    # mc "Can you sing it?"
    mc "你能唱一下吗？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5879
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_4e82630b:

    # g "You mean now?"
    g "现在？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5880
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f11d3738:

    # mc "Yep! I want to hear what it sounds like."
    mc "对啊！我想听听。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5883
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c8bce33b:

    # g "Well..."
    g "好吧……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5884
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_369f8537:

    # g "Here goes nothing."
    g "唱一下也不会怎么样。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5887
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_3cc28b9e:

    # g "When the sunlight hits my face, it won't be long..."
    g "当阳光洒在我的脸上时，我知道我马上就可以……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5888
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_2543abc8:

    # g "'Til the time I can forget when I felt strong..."
    g "忘记掉所有我曾坚强过的时刻……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5891
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c6c958b5:

    # g "But until the night I'm in your arms again..."
    g "但是直到我再次回到你的怀抱里的夜晚之前……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5892
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_66ba2c7b:

    # g "I don't wanna get my hopes up in the end..."
    g "我都不敢有太多虚幻的希望……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5895
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_4b340443_6:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5896
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_bd139d87:

    # mc "You're... so goddamn beautiful..."
    mc "你……好美……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5899
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_08a79ca8:

    # g "What?"
    g "什么？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5902
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_d7b0e0ee:

    # mc "No, no, the song! I meant that song was beautiful!"
    mc "不，不，是歌！我说你的歌好美！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5905
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_4b340443_7:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5908
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_3704f1b9:

    # g "I'll be here the day after graduation."
    g "毕业之后那天，我会来这里。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5909
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_579bea7f:

    # g "Come meet me if you want to. If not, I'll still be waiting for you."
    g "如果你愿意，就来见我。如果你不愿意，我也依然会等你。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5912
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_a77b2e3b:

    # mc "You know, you sound so different these past few days. What's happening with you?"
    mc "你这几天说话很不一样啊。到底怎么了？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5915
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_ad952a38:

    # g "Nothing, just come if you have time, okay? I'll sing you the entire song."
    g "没事，你有时间的话来见我就行了，好吗？我会把整首歌唱给你听。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5916
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f3c09568:

    # mc "For real?! Alright, I'll have to come then!"
    mc "真的吗？！好啊，那我一定要来了！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5924
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_e36ad95b:

    # mc "*sighs* I wish I had asked for her phone number."
    mc "*叹气* 我要是问她要了手机号就好了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5927
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_bee25702:

    # jo "Young man."
    jo "小伙子。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5928
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_6942f302:

    # mc "Johnny."
    mc "强尼。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5931
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_b03c42ef:

    # jo "The young lady said you would be here."
    jo "小姐说了你会来的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5932
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f1635765:

    # mc "Where's Gwen? I've been waiting for her since morning."
    mc "格温在哪？我从早上等她一直等到现在了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5933
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_bc8c45d2:

    # jo "Young Miss won't able to come. She's not feeling very well and couldn't get up from bed."
    jo "小姐没法来了。她身体不舒服，没法下床。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5934
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_cf4d092e:

    # mc "Oh, that's... too bad."
    mc "哦，这……太糟糕了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5935
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_a9347f8c:

    # mc "Then, can you give me her number instead? I want to ask how she's doing."
    mc "那，你能把她的电话给我吗？我想问问她的情况。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5936
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_45aa9c8f:

    # jo "I'm afraid I don't have the authority to give her contact information away."
    jo "抱歉，我不能私自透露她的联系方式。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5939
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_751f83b7:

    # jo "However, she gave me this."
    jo "不过，她给了我这个。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5942
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_4aaf5cc6:

    # mc "It's the song's lyrics..."
    mc "是那首歌的歌词……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5943
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_2a8aa067:

    # jo "She asked me to give it to you and told me that I must tell you that she's..."
    jo "她让我把这个转交给你，还嘱咐我一定告诉你，她很……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5947
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_25e5c1a6:

    # g "*hics* Sorry... I'm sorry..."
    g "*抽泣* 对不起……真的对不起……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5948
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_207bde8c:

    # g "*hics* Why am I... a fucking coward when it comes to you?!"
    g "*抽泣* 为什么我……为什么我在你面前永远是个胆小鬼？！"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5953
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_88b82c00:

    # mc "That's why you didn't come... you were afraid to tell me how you felt."
    mc "所以你才没有来……你害怕把你内心的感情告诉我。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5954
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_56ab3789:

    # mc "But why? Why were you so afraid?"
    mc "可是为什么啊？为什么你会害怕？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5963
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_8a23442f:

    # g "It was certainly fear..."
    g "我的确是怕了……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5964
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_4dbb393f:

    # g "I was afraid that opening up and confessing my feelings for you would make me feel vulnerable."
    g "我害怕敞开心扉，说出我对你的感情，会让我觉得自己很脆弱。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5965
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c072b246:

    # g "I feared that expressing my feelings might expose me to emotional risks and weaken me."
    g "我害怕说出我的感情可能会让我受伤，无力。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5966
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_226d2dc9:

    # g "Honestly, I still feel the same way. But now that we've passed that barrier, I feel more comfortable telling you all this."
    g "其实，我现在依然有这种感觉。但我们现在已经跨越了那层障碍，我就能把这一切都告诉你了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5967
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_91234e5c:

    # mc "Hold on. So the reason why you left your company was..."
    mc "等等。所以你离开公司的原因是……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5968
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_25876721:

    # g "You."
    g "你。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5969
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_3dbe1636:

    # g "To overcome my {i}only{/i} failure in life."
    g "是为了跨越我人生中{i}唯一{/i}的失败。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5970
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_edbc0d5e:

    # g "To gain what I failed to get before, even if it meant risking my whole heart."
    g "是为了把我以前没有拿到的东西重新拿回来，哪怕我可能会心碎。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5971
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_9388e6bc:

    # g "And most importantly, to pursue what I truly want."
    g "还有最重要的是，为了追求我真正想要的东西。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5972
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_786e3cf3:

    # g "Without you, a huge part of me was missing."
    g "没有你，我内心的很大一部分也会消失不见。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5973
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f4f207b6:

    # g "It wasn't the company or the money that completed me, but {i}you{/i}."
    g "能让我完整的不是公司，也不是钱，而是{i}你{/i}。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5974
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_d0180bcc:

    # g "I fell hard for you, [mc]. And I never, {i}ever{/i} forgot about you."
    g "我深深爱上你了，[mc!t]。而且我从来，从来没有忘记你。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5975
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_62eafe31:

    # mc "Shit, Gwen..."
    mc "操，格温……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5976
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_194d25cc:

    # mc "You're making me fall in love with you again."
    mc "你让我又爱上你了。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5977
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_29405281:

    # mc "... Although, I don't feel like I deserve what you did for me."
    mc "……但是，我并不觉得我配得上你为我做的这一切。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5978
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_ef756750:

    # mc "I'm just me. Nothing but an average Joe who flips burgers every day."
    mc "我就只是我而已。一个每天做汉堡的普通人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5979
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_b30836a3:

    # mc "Compared to what you could've had with your company, dropping everything to pursue this unremarkable guy is a major downgrade."
    mc "跟你在你的公司里可能取得的成就相比，放弃一切去追求一个默默无闻的男人很不值得。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5980
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_b50a5258:

    # g "That was one of my worries if I told you I left my company for you: I didn't want you to judge yourself."
    g "我之所以没有告诉你我离开公司是为了你，很大一部分原因就是你刚刚说的话。我不想让你看低自己。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5981
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_9ac045d4:

    # g "However, think of what you did for me."
    g "你要想想你为我做过的事。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5982
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_feec8ce9:

    # g "To me, you're not unremarkable nor just an average guy, [mc]."
    g "对我来说，你不是默默无闻的普通人，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5983
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c23ca9ce:

    # g "I knew I would find my happiness with you."
    g "我知道我在你身边一定会幸福的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5984
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_7def1088:

    # g "Even if you were just a dime-a-dozen guy, I'm not looking for somebody with superhuman gifts."
    g "哪怕你是个普普通通的人也好，我本来也不想要什么有超人天赋的人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5985
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_5dca0388:

    # g "Or a superhero in some fairytale shit."
    g "或者是什么童话故事里的超级英雄。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5986
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_a63f3e0f:

    # g "Just someone I can turn to, somebody I can kiss."
    g "我只想要一个可以依靠，可以亲吻的人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5987
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_f940d4cc:

    # g "Ever since what happened in that bathroom, it's always been only you for me."
    g "自从那天在厕所里的那件事以来，我的眼里就一直只有你一个人。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5988
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_4bc5dd78:

    # g "And I'm willing to give everything away just to have you in my arms again."
    g "我愿意放弃一切，只为再次拥你入怀。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5989
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_02f9a46d:

    # g "That's how much I love you, [mc]."
    g "我就是这么爱你，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5993
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_a5d1a2e2:

    # mc "Well, I think I'll have to apologize for being so naive. I'm sorry."
    mc "好吧，看来我要道个歉，我太天真了。对不起。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5994
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_b9600291:

    # g "It doesn't matter now. We're far and beyond that in our relationship, aren’t we?"
    g "现在都已经无所谓了。我们的关系早就过了在意这种事的地步，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5995
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_5b2f177f:

    # mc "Hm, you got a point."
    mc "嗯，你说得对。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5996
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_29ae0b51:

    # mc "So... the song. You dedicated it to me."
    mc "所以……那首歌，是写给我的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5997
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_a2a7a814:

    # g "No, it's a song dedicated to {i}me{/i}."
    g "不，那首歌是写给{i}我{/i}的。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5998
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_c51110c4:

    # g "It could be heard as a love song at first, but..."
    g "第一次听可能会以为是一首情歌，但是……"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5999
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_953c4545:

    # g "It's a song about longing, vulnerability, and the struggle to find strength and hope amidst personal challenges."
    g "这首歌写的是渴望，脆弱，还有在自我面对挑战时，寻找力量和希望的挣扎。"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:6000
translate chinese gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_a16be046:

    # g "The lyrics suggest that somebody is going through a difficult time and is seeking solace and support from a significant person in their life."
